1
00:03:26,883 --> 00:03:28,898
Like any other day, this man wakes up

2
00:03:29,343 --> 00:03:35,024
opens his palms, and believes he has everything
under control, what he did not see coming

3
00:03:35,145 --> 00:03:38,505
is that from today his
fate is about to change

4
00:03:38,984 --> 00:03:45,424
During a police lathi charge, the innocent
also get beaten up along with the culprit

5
00:03:45,704 --> 00:03:49,703
In the same way, his fate and that of
four others, is about to change forever

6
00:03:49,704 --> 00:03:51,744
And the irony is,
none of them have the slightest clue

7
00:03:53,744 --> 00:03:57,464
Waking up early, sweeping,
rangoli at the entrance, you do none of these

8
00:03:57,465 --> 00:03:59,383
How will you even manage your
husband's house when you are married?

9
00:03:59,384 --> 00:04:03,623
Relax! Just get a son-in-law
who does all these chores...

10
00:04:03,624 --> 00:04:04,304
She ruined my sleep!

11
00:04:05,384 --> 00:04:07,105
'Ananth Nambiar
Retd. IAS'

12
00:04:39,825 --> 00:04:40,943
Did he agree?

13
00:04:40,944 --> 00:04:41,505
Yes, sir

14
00:04:42,744 --> 00:04:43,785
Final figure

15
00:04:44,265 --> 00:04:46,303
Has law become so expensive?

16
00:04:46,304 --> 00:04:47,145
Yes, sir

17
00:04:53,304 --> 00:04:55,784
If Dhanush was here at a time like this

18
00:04:55,785 --> 00:04:57,304
wouldn't it have been so nice, brother?

19
00:04:57,825 --> 00:05:01,545
To me, Dhanush and your
sons are one and the same

20
00:05:01,944 --> 00:05:04,624
Uncle, you mean the world to my mother

21
00:05:04,744 --> 00:05:07,344
She'd let go of her kids,
but never her brother

22
00:05:09,024 --> 00:05:10,104
See you, sister

23
00:05:10,105 --> 00:05:11,703
Hail Rajashekar Anna!

24
00:05:11,704 --> 00:05:13,743
Hail CM Rajashekar Anna!

25
00:05:13,744 --> 00:05:15,703
Hail Chief Minister Rajashekar!

26
00:05:15,704 --> 00:05:17,505
Hail Rajashekar Anna, "The ally of the poor!"

27
00:05:18,344 --> 00:05:19,664
Where's Ranganna?
Can't see him anywhere

28
00:05:19,984 --> 00:05:21,303
I'm here, Anna!

29
00:05:21,304 --> 00:05:23,063
Ah, come here, come!

30
00:05:23,064 --> 00:05:25,023
Anna, I swear on my mother

31
00:05:25,024 --> 00:05:26,703
If anything happens to you,
I'll raise hell, Anna!

32
00:05:26,704 --> 00:05:27,824
I'll burn down the whole city!

33
00:05:27,825 --> 00:05:29,704
No, stop, this is what is not needed

34
00:05:30,384 --> 00:05:34,544
I knew you'd be up to something stupid,
that is why I singled you out

35
00:05:34,545 --> 00:05:35,184
Alright, Anna

36
00:05:35,185 --> 00:05:36,383
Take it easy, Ranganna

37
00:05:36,384 --> 00:05:37,184
Nothing will happen to me

38
00:05:37,185 --> 00:05:38,104
Okay, Anna, alright!

39
00:05:38,105 --> 00:05:39,343
Hail Rajashekar Anna!

40
00:05:39,344 --> 00:05:41,264
Sir, we're late for the court
- Let's go

41
00:05:41,265 --> 00:05:43,465
All hail Chief Minister Rajashekar Anna!

42
00:05:44,024 --> 00:05:45,824
Uncle, who's that Ranganna?

43
00:05:45,825 --> 00:05:47,505
It's all politics, my boy

44
00:05:47,905 --> 00:05:51,504
Rama, Ranga, Shankara,
are common names in a crowd

45
00:05:51,505 --> 00:05:52,145
Oh!

46
00:05:52,424 --> 00:05:54,743
Now that I singled him out of
the crowd and spoke to him

47
00:05:54,744 --> 00:05:58,384
he'll be trumpeting all over
the city that 'CM is simple'

48
00:06:00,944 --> 00:06:02,943
Clear out the crowd

49
00:06:02,944 --> 00:06:04,624
Maintain control, don't allow anyone through

50
00:06:04,744 --> 00:06:06,184
Sir, here, one question, please!

51
00:06:06,185 --> 00:06:07,423
One by one...

52
00:06:07,424 --> 00:06:10,144
Sir, Mr. Patil from your own party
has gone on record

53
00:06:10,145 --> 00:06:12,343
saying, this case will go against you for sure

54
00:06:12,344 --> 00:06:15,224
He's long been expelled from our party

55
00:06:15,225 --> 00:06:18,983
I've been CM for three terms,
could be he's jealous of me

56
00:06:18,984 --> 00:06:19,864
Sir
- Huh?

57
00:06:19,865 --> 00:06:22,624
Sir, if the verdict is against you,
what's your next move?

58
00:06:22,944 --> 00:06:25,224
Is this a question, or your wish?

59
00:06:25,225 --> 00:06:26,423
Sir, it's getting late

60
00:06:26,424 --> 00:06:27,343
Ha!

61
00:06:27,344 --> 00:06:28,383
I'll call for a press meet this evening

62
00:06:28,384 --> 00:06:29,663
Sir, sir, last question!
- Sir, please!

63
00:06:29,664 --> 00:06:30,344
See you in the evening

64
00:06:32,585 --> 00:06:35,423
Upon thorough review of the investigation

65
00:06:35,424 --> 00:06:37,383
the accused, Mr. Rajashekar

66
00:06:37,384 --> 00:06:40,545
has been proven guilty of corruption
based on evidences found

67
00:06:56,984 --> 00:06:59,704
With Chief Minister Rajashekar's
corruption coming to light

68
00:06:59,825 --> 00:07:02,505
the Special Court for People's Representatives
has handed down a severe punishment

69
00:07:03,744 --> 00:07:06,063
He stated that he'd hold
a press meet tonight

70
00:07:06,064 --> 00:07:07,663
but now he's going to be jail-bound

71
00:07:07,664 --> 00:07:08,983
[loud commotion]

72
00:07:08,984 --> 00:07:10,904
[protesters yelling]

73
00:07:10,905 --> 00:07:13,905
[people shouting in protest]

74
00:07:14,865 --> 00:07:17,984
Rajashekar's arrest has
left the CM's post vacant

75
00:07:18,465 --> 00:07:21,105
'Who's next to take the reins of the state?'

76
00:07:24,105 --> 00:07:24,984
[door shuts]

77
00:07:25,185 --> 00:07:30,424
Ah! Welcome, "Odysseus of politics"
and former IAS officer, Ananth Nambiar!

78
00:07:30,825 --> 00:07:35,104
Don't assume that simply wearing and posing
in a British coat will make anything work

79
00:07:35,105 --> 00:07:37,144
They greased the judge's palms more than we did

80
00:07:37,145 --> 00:07:38,584
and flipped the case in their favor

81
00:07:38,585 --> 00:07:40,344
Is this the foul play of that bloody Patil?

82
00:07:40,905 --> 00:07:43,105
Your younger sister's children
are involved too, sir

83
00:07:45,545 --> 00:07:46,865
All for the greed of CM's chair

84
00:07:47,505 --> 00:07:51,105
They think your jail time is their chance to be CM,
so they've teamed up with Patil

85
00:07:52,304 --> 00:07:54,384
Bloody backstabbers!

86
00:07:56,105 --> 00:07:59,825
They think their uncle is old and useless!

87
00:08:01,024 --> 00:08:02,825
Mr. Nambiar, do one thing

88
00:08:03,505 --> 00:08:06,465
Get 30 MLAs to resign

89
00:08:08,105 --> 00:08:09,664
Let the government dissolve

90
00:08:10,505 --> 00:08:13,505
I'll show them my prowess
in the by-election!

91
00:08:13,744 --> 00:08:16,624
Even if your party wins in the by-election,
you can't become CM

92
00:08:17,024 --> 00:08:17,984
That's the law, sir

93
00:08:18,185 --> 00:08:20,944
A convicted person is barred from
running for election for six years

94
00:08:23,064 --> 00:08:25,785
Once I was a mere
garbage picking contractor

95
00:08:26,465 --> 00:08:28,505
to become a Chief Minister today

96
00:08:29,384 --> 00:08:32,545
Just imagine how many heads I've str*ked
and how many I've had rolled!

97
00:08:33,063 --> 00:08:34,384
Get this into your head

98
00:08:35,585 --> 00:08:39,423
The CM's chair is always mine,
and after me, only my son will reign on it!

99
00:08:40,505 --> 00:08:41,624
Bring Dhanush over

100
00:08:42,264 --> 00:08:44,905
If you abruptly bring Dhanush
and put him on the CM chair

101
00:08:45,585 --> 00:08:47,585
the party will shatter
like a rock-struck beehive

102
00:08:47,825 --> 00:08:50,465
The party exists because of me alone,
not because of any other scoundrels!

103
00:08:51,344 --> 00:08:53,545
Bring my son and seat him on that CM chair

104
00:08:53,984 --> 00:08:55,185
Will your son agree to it?

105
00:08:55,704 --> 00:08:56,664
Will he come?

106
00:08:57,064 --> 00:09:00,185
Mr. Nambiar, when a man with a stick
calls a cow, it won't come

107
00:09:00,744 --> 00:09:03,664
but if he calls with feed,
even a celestial elephant will come

108
00:09:03,785 --> 00:09:05,585
If you ask, he will come for sure

109
00:09:08,944 --> 00:09:11,623
'Until now, the father's
fate was mine to write'

110
00:09:11,624 --> 00:09:13,865
'from now on, the son's fate
is mine to write too!'

111
00:09:28,785 --> 00:09:31,905
"Gijigalakama Rakaa Lakama
Gijigalakama Rakaa"

112
00:09:32,064 --> 00:09:35,383
"Lights on, showtime lit!
Guaranteed blockbuster hit!"

113
00:09:35,384 --> 00:09:38,703
"Generation to generation'u
Hearts warm, they throng and swarm"

114
00:09:38,704 --> 00:09:42,225
"Hey lovelies! Oy lovelies!
He breaks all-time records"

115
00:09:42,384 --> 00:09:45,904
"My people are my boss
I live for my fans"

116
00:09:45,905 --> 00:09:49,303
"Bond close, I'll give my all
Keep that brohood"

117
00:09:49,304 --> 00:09:52,743
"First-day, first-show, at theatres
In the crowd-bound loud sound"

118
00:09:52,744 --> 00:09:55,984
"Those who celebrate,
they're the true celebrities"

119
00:09:56,105 --> 00:09:59,464
"If hunger calls, let achievement rise"

120
00:09:59,465 --> 00:10:02,704
"For those who toil, glory takes its time"

121
00:10:02,984 --> 00:10:06,145
"For me, my language
is my priority"

122
00:10:06,304 --> 00:10:09,545
"Plain and clear, I say, take heed"

123
00:10:10,024 --> 00:10:11,944
"Life's meant for peace, no less!"

124
00:10:13,265 --> 00:10:16,265
"Gijigalakama Rakaa Lakama
Gijigalakama Rakaa"

125
00:10:16,545 --> 00:10:19,663
"Lights on, showtime lit!
Guaranteed blockbuster hit!"

126
00:10:19,664 --> 00:10:23,104
"Generation to generation'u
Hearts warm, they throng and swarm"

127
00:10:23,105 --> 00:10:24,785
"Forever record breaks!"

128
00:10:56,105 --> 00:10:59,344
"Cut-out life-size,
I'm the hero they idolize!"

129
00:10:59,505 --> 00:11:02,265
"Arrogant? Not me, no chance!"

130
00:11:02,865 --> 00:11:06,185
"As good as anyone"

131
00:11:06,304 --> 00:11:08,825
"With that attitude, advance!"

132
00:11:09,505 --> 00:11:12,904
"Born and bred in this land
Here we earn by honest hand"

133
00:11:12,905 --> 00:11:16,264
"We prosper our land
OG locals, we are!"

134
00:11:16,265 --> 00:11:19,784
"Be you the Richest of the rich,
or the Lord of every land"

135
00:11:19,785 --> 00:11:22,785
"Only those who love me
are celebrities I've found"

136
00:11:23,105 --> 00:11:24,383
"Come what may..."

137
00:11:24,384 --> 00:11:26,185
"True to you, we'll never sway!"

138
00:11:26,424 --> 00:11:27,824
"In my heart..."

139
00:11:27,825 --> 00:11:29,704
"We're etched forever!"

140
00:11:29,984 --> 00:11:33,185
"Others' small-time stories? Nah, we pass!"

141
00:11:33,424 --> 00:11:36,704
"Plain and clear, I say, take heed"

142
00:11:37,024 --> 00:11:38,704
"Life's meant for peace, no less!"

143
00:11:40,225 --> 00:11:43,304
"Gijigalakama Rakaa Lakama
Gijigalakama Rakaa"

144
00:11:43,585 --> 00:11:46,465
"Lights on, showtime lit!
Guaranteed blockbuster hit!"

145
00:11:46,744 --> 00:11:50,144
"Generation to generation'u
Hearts warm, they throng and swarm"

146
00:11:50,145 --> 00:11:51,825
"Forever record breaks!"

147
00:12:19,704 --> 00:12:20,584
Super, Boss!

148
00:12:20,585 --> 00:12:21,383
Good one!

149
00:12:21,384 --> 00:12:22,743
Shot okay?
- Okay, sir

150
00:12:22,744 --> 00:12:23,623
Super, sir!

151
00:12:23,624 --> 00:12:25,465
[applause and cheering]

152
00:12:27,304 --> 00:12:29,384
[crowd erupts in cheers]

153
00:12:30,024 --> 00:12:34,265
[crowd hails in unison]

154
00:12:34,944 --> 00:12:36,983
This is my only request to all my fans!

155
00:12:36,984 --> 00:12:39,663
Please stop pouring milk on my
cutouts and banners, don't waste it!

156
00:12:39,664 --> 00:12:40,904
Instead, give it to poor kids

157
00:12:40,905 --> 00:12:42,023
let them drink and be healthy!

158
00:12:42,024 --> 00:12:44,184
Please listen to me, all fans...
- Boss... Boss...

159
00:12:44,185 --> 00:12:45,145
BOSS!

160
00:12:46,304 --> 00:12:48,024
Damn it! Nani, what the hell!

161
00:12:49,024 --> 00:12:51,465
I was lost in a fantastic dream in my sleep!

162
00:12:52,024 --> 00:12:55,344
In my dream, I was a big star
making a powerful mass-song entry!

163
00:12:55,585 --> 00:12:59,144
All my fans were giving milk baths
to my cutouts and banners!

164
00:12:59,145 --> 00:13:00,224
And you woke me up!

165
00:13:00,225 --> 00:13:02,544
Might as well dream of making money!

166
00:13:02,545 --> 00:13:04,304
Sigh! Damn it!

167
00:13:05,424 --> 00:13:06,585
Nani...

168
00:13:07,265 --> 00:13:09,464
I've had just one dream since I was a kid

169
00:13:09,465 --> 00:13:10,265
What's that?

170
00:13:10,744 --> 00:13:12,865
To become a good actor

171
00:13:13,424 --> 00:13:15,825
Uff! But it feels like it
happens only in my dreams!

172
00:13:16,465 --> 00:13:20,023
I'm just waiting for that Lord Shiva
to make my dream come true!

173
00:13:20,024 --> 00:13:23,184
If Lord Shiva can grant
Atmalinga to Ravana

174
00:13:23,185 --> 00:13:24,383
here, you are a "king"

175
00:13:24,384 --> 00:13:26,585
If you ask, won't he
give you a shot at acting?

176
00:13:26,704 --> 00:13:30,743
Never before, never after
in Karnataka has He granted

177
00:13:30,744 --> 00:13:32,824
such a stardom He will give you!

178
00:13:32,825 --> 00:13:34,225
Eyy, don't worry, Boss!

179
00:13:34,505 --> 00:13:37,743
From ladle to cutout,
what a jump it'll be!

180
00:13:37,744 --> 00:13:39,104
You say so?
- Yeah!

181
00:13:39,105 --> 00:13:39,864
Ah!

182
00:13:39,865 --> 00:13:40,703
Aha!

183
00:13:40,704 --> 00:13:44,184
When you step out of a
foreign car in a suit and goggles

184
00:13:44,185 --> 00:13:47,785
photographers will go
click, click, click on you!

185
00:15:25,624 --> 00:15:28,423
Karunaada People's Party collapses

186
00:15:28,424 --> 00:15:33,264
'The Election Commission has announced
the date for the state legislature elections'

187
00:15:33,265 --> 00:15:34,584
Ugh, damn it!

188
00:15:34,585 --> 00:15:36,664
All our plans have gone up in smoke!

189
00:15:37,145 --> 00:15:39,145
I was aiming for at least six months as CM!

190
00:15:39,664 --> 00:15:41,225
That damn uncle of mine
ruined that chance too!

191
00:15:41,545 --> 00:15:43,624
That old man isn't giving up
the CM chair until he dies!

192
00:15:43,744 --> 00:15:45,984
Jana! Mind your tongue!

193
00:15:46,505 --> 00:15:48,224
Show respect, he's your uncle!

194
00:15:48,225 --> 00:15:49,545
Yeah, that's fine!

195
00:15:50,185 --> 00:15:52,865
But your brother...
Instead of these two

196
00:15:53,024 --> 00:15:56,505
who else is he trying to put in
the CM's seat with all this drama?

197
00:15:56,984 --> 00:15:58,064
Dhanush!

198
00:15:58,905 --> 00:16:01,063
It's been ages since he disappeared

199
00:16:01,064 --> 00:16:03,344
Could be my brother's got a plan behind that

200
00:16:03,865 --> 00:16:06,704
If blood type is simply positive
or negative for everyone

201
00:16:07,145 --> 00:16:09,024
my brother's is full-on political type!

202
00:16:09,304 --> 00:16:11,465
But one thing puzzles me

203
00:16:12,384 --> 00:16:15,905
Are you on your brother's side
or your sons' side?

204
00:16:16,465 --> 00:16:19,024
I have both respect and fear for my brother

205
00:16:19,304 --> 00:16:22,024
but I also care for my sons' future

206
00:16:22,825 --> 00:16:24,825
You still haven't given a proper answer

207
00:16:25,505 --> 00:16:28,424
Jana and Poorna,
I warning you two!

208
00:16:29,585 --> 00:16:30,984
What's happening, guys?

209
00:16:31,424 --> 00:16:34,185
Your mother is suddenly bringing
Dhanush into the picture

210
00:16:34,304 --> 00:16:35,784
We're ready for that too

211
00:16:35,785 --> 00:16:38,504
Jana, call that photographer

212
00:16:38,505 --> 00:16:39,344
Hmm

213
00:16:45,545 --> 00:16:46,383
Hello

214
00:16:46,384 --> 00:16:47,585
What's the update on the assignment?

215
00:16:47,905 --> 00:16:49,265
I was waiting for your call

216
00:16:49,505 --> 00:16:50,904
Actually, the job's done

217
00:16:50,905 --> 00:16:52,984
Payment first, and then
I'll send all the photos and videos

218
00:16:53,304 --> 00:16:56,024
How's payment supposed to be made
without first confirming the job's done?

219
00:16:58,744 --> 00:17:00,744
I've sent a photo, take a look

220
00:17:04,105 --> 00:17:07,784
I asked for Dhanush's pic,
and you've sent some hero's pic!

221
00:17:07,785 --> 00:17:09,905
Don't judge his personality
just from a photo, sir

222
00:17:10,024 --> 00:17:11,742
Yeah, looks-wise he's a hero

223
00:17:11,743 --> 00:17:14,825
but when he's sloshed,
he's full-on terror!

224
00:17:15,464 --> 00:17:17,064
In one line

225
00:17:17,344 --> 00:17:19,304
he's a monster in human form

226
00:17:19,983 --> 00:17:23,145
He's a deadly combination
of tsunami and tornado

227
00:17:28,585 --> 00:17:30,465
Send all his videos immediately

228
00:17:30,825 --> 00:17:33,505
Full payment first,
then I send all the photos and videos

229
00:17:33,785 --> 00:17:34,904
No, but...

230
00:17:34,905 --> 00:17:35,704
Hello...

231
00:17:36,064 --> 00:17:36,664
Hello...

232
00:17:45,465 --> 00:17:49,505
There's a little baby in our house

233
00:17:50,744 --> 00:17:54,785
When anyone tries to click its photo,
it gets super mad

234
00:17:56,384 --> 00:18:00,384
And if someone clicks anyway?
Theirs hand will meet its wrath

235
00:18:01,105 --> 00:18:03,744
Sarasu, aren't you curious
to know the baby's name?

236
00:18:04,944 --> 00:18:06,984
DEVIL

237
00:18:09,505 --> 00:18:11,704
THE DEVIL

238
00:18:14,344 --> 00:18:18,185
Do not take my pictures without my permission

239
00:18:18,505 --> 00:18:20,505
I will, so what?

240
00:18:20,744 --> 00:18:21,825
Kannada?

241
00:18:22,704 --> 00:18:23,984
Huh!

242
00:18:24,545 --> 00:18:29,105
Your milky white skin had me thinking
you were Ukrainian or Palestinian

243
00:18:29,704 --> 00:18:32,984
A brother from... another mother

244
00:18:33,465 --> 00:18:35,265
But not the same father

245
00:18:41,505 --> 00:18:44,905
Following me, clicking my pictures...

246
00:18:45,984 --> 00:18:48,265
And spouting words without respect

247
00:18:48,465 --> 00:18:50,465
Devil is not okay with it, bro

248
00:18:50,624 --> 00:18:52,984
Giving respect and asking permission

249
00:18:53,545 --> 00:18:55,624
I do that only with true gentlemen

250
00:18:56,304 --> 00:18:58,225
not with rogues like you!

251
00:18:58,905 --> 00:19:00,785
[Devil's laughter]

252
00:19:01,024 --> 00:19:03,024
The situation's clearly asking for it

253
00:19:03,545 --> 00:19:05,865
and your words provoke sharply

254
00:19:07,024 --> 00:19:08,105
Yet...

255
00:19:08,424 --> 00:19:12,424
The sentiment that you're one of us,
a Kannadiga, is holding me back

256
00:19:16,825 --> 00:19:18,743
Oh my God!
- Nooo! Oh God!

257
00:19:18,744 --> 00:19:20,104
Run, run!

258
00:19:20,105 --> 00:19:23,145
[people flee in panic]

259
00:19:26,585 --> 00:19:27,864
Delete it, bro

260
00:19:27,865 --> 00:19:31,145
Manhood isn't what you show off
in the restroom in front of women

261
00:19:33,145 --> 00:19:35,024
If you're man enough

262
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:40,145
touch this camera

263
00:19:59,905 --> 00:20:01,664
Challenge... for me?

264
00:20:53,905 --> 00:20:55,105
Come on!

265
00:22:53,384 --> 00:22:55,105
The DEVIL

266
00:24:18,344 --> 00:24:19,383
Tell me this, dear

267
00:24:19,384 --> 00:24:19,984
Hmm

268
00:24:20,465 --> 00:24:24,384
Always on your toes for your CM's work, right?

269
00:24:24,664 --> 00:24:26,145
My CM?

270
00:24:26,304 --> 00:24:30,265
Rajashekar, three-time CM?
That's me and my brains

271
00:24:31,225 --> 00:24:34,743
A single Chethak scooter and a 30X40 plot

272
00:24:34,744 --> 00:24:37,465
to my father, that alone
was life's big achievement

273
00:24:38,384 --> 00:24:39,944
I am the son of such a man

274
00:24:40,664 --> 00:24:45,225
One word from me can
make or break the government

275
00:24:48,105 --> 00:24:52,185
People don't call me "Odyssey of politics"
or "Kingmaker" without reason

276
00:24:53,024 --> 00:24:59,624
All that wit, have you ever felt that you've used
it in a way that served people well?

277
00:25:00,384 --> 00:25:04,744
For me, my own existence comes first,
above people's reputation

278
00:25:14,744 --> 00:25:19,184
'Bang, bang, don't you hide'

279
00:25:19,185 --> 00:25:21,185
'Time to run...'
- Dhanush...

280
00:25:23,145 --> 00:25:24,505
Uncs!

281
00:25:24,825 --> 00:25:27,145
What a pleasant surprise!

282
00:25:28,545 --> 00:25:31,225
I was wondering, not a single crow
in sight for the funeral spread!

283
00:25:31,865 --> 00:25:33,664
You're here, perfect timing!

284
00:25:37,545 --> 00:25:41,224
N-No! No! No! Please!

285
00:25:41,225 --> 00:25:42,624
Shoo shoo!

286
00:25:43,024 --> 00:25:43,824
Dhanush!

287
00:25:43,825 --> 00:25:45,424
Away with you!

288
00:25:46,825 --> 00:25:47,864
Who's this guy?

289
00:25:47,865 --> 00:25:48,744
Why did you kill him?

290
00:25:49,624 --> 00:25:53,424
Clicking photos without
permission is an offense, Uncs

291
00:25:53,585 --> 00:25:55,145
Just for clicking photos?

292
00:25:55,825 --> 00:25:57,063
What if the cops show up?

293
00:25:57,064 --> 00:25:58,225
Show up, huh?

294
00:26:05,704 --> 00:26:07,464
You haven't changed even
after coming here, have you?

295
00:26:07,465 --> 00:26:10,505
Changed? I've improved a lot, actually

296
00:26:15,865 --> 00:26:17,384
We got the money

297
00:26:17,585 --> 00:26:18,464
Thanks, Devil!

298
00:26:18,465 --> 00:26:19,344
Bye, Devil!

299
00:26:20,585 --> 00:26:22,585
What did the cops call you
when they left?

300
00:26:23,105 --> 00:26:24,865
DEVIL

301
00:26:25,344 --> 00:26:26,944
THE DEVIL

302
00:26:28,865 --> 00:26:35,304
My wild ways have earned me a name
Fondly, people here call me 'The Devil'

303
00:26:35,545 --> 00:26:37,384
You bought off the police here too?

304
00:26:37,624 --> 00:26:40,585
The whole world knows one universal language

305
00:26:41,384 --> 00:26:42,624
MONEY

306
00:26:42,825 --> 00:26:46,663
With it, you can buy the laws of the land
and even the loyalty of men

307
00:26:46,664 --> 00:26:48,344
Do you even know the value of money?

308
00:26:48,785 --> 00:26:50,585
I know only two things

309
00:26:52,145 --> 00:26:54,585
The poem my mother taught me

310
00:26:55,225 --> 00:26:58,225
'There's a little baby in our house...'

311
00:26:59,624 --> 00:27:01,944
And the prose your CM taught me

312
00:27:02,624 --> 00:27:04,465
'If you desire something, ask for it'

313
00:27:05,024 --> 00:27:07,145
'If it's denied, take it by force'

314
00:27:10,545 --> 00:27:12,825
Remember what he said
when he sent me off from India?

315
00:27:12,944 --> 00:27:17,024
I've got money to spare for him, but not time

316
00:27:18,944 --> 00:27:20,744
[Devil's laughter]

317
00:27:21,505 --> 00:27:24,984
He gives, I throw it around recklessly

318
00:27:26,785 --> 00:27:28,064
Anyways, Uncs

319
00:27:28,944 --> 00:27:30,224
Have a peg

320
00:27:30,225 --> 00:27:31,184
No, I'll pass

321
00:27:31,185 --> 00:27:33,225
From what I've seen of you,
my head's already spinning

322
00:27:33,505 --> 00:27:35,544
Do you have any idea
what's happening in Karnataka?

323
00:27:35,545 --> 00:27:36,865
'Breaking News!'

324
00:27:37,384 --> 00:27:39,465
'CM Rajashekar arrested'

325
00:27:39,664 --> 00:27:42,424
'Karnataka's political scene totally messed up'

326
00:27:42,624 --> 00:27:44,865
You know everything, right?
Then pack your bags for India

327
00:27:45,225 --> 00:27:46,265
Why?

328
00:27:47,024 --> 00:27:48,224
To become CM

329
00:27:48,225 --> 00:27:49,704
It's your father's wish

330
00:27:50,505 --> 00:27:54,185
So my royal phase begins now, huh?

331
00:27:54,384 --> 00:27:56,225
[Devil's laughter]

332
00:27:58,105 --> 00:28:01,105
Damn it! That guy isn't picking up the phone!

333
00:28:01,304 --> 00:28:03,383
First, we greased the judge's palms

334
00:28:03,384 --> 00:28:05,383
now we've stuffed the
photographer's pockets too

335
00:28:05,384 --> 00:28:07,905
I trusted your plan and
sank my cash into this

336
00:28:08,704 --> 00:28:11,865
It's my money slipping through every time

337
00:28:12,664 --> 00:28:15,105
This was our only hook to trap Dhanush!

338
00:28:15,265 --> 00:28:16,424
Now even that is gone!

339
00:28:17,024 --> 00:28:19,984
All we need is one loophole
and we'll pounce!

340
00:28:20,304 --> 00:28:21,865
What did that photographer say?

341
00:28:22,785 --> 00:28:24,624
He called Dhanush a 'terror', didn't he?

342
00:28:25,505 --> 00:28:27,664
Then we start with his
character assassination first

343
00:28:28,664 --> 00:28:29,664
Jana...

344
00:28:29,825 --> 00:28:32,145
Make Dhanush's photo go viral

345
00:28:32,304 --> 00:28:33,303
Hmm

346
00:28:33,304 --> 00:28:35,344
The media will do the rest
to finish him off

347
00:28:35,744 --> 00:28:39,383
'Dhanush Rajashekar's photo,
son of the former CM, has gone viral'

348
00:28:39,384 --> 00:28:42,464
'Creating a huge stir on social platforms'

349
00:28:42,465 --> 00:28:47,064
'With elections nearby, the rumour of
Dhanush's return is spreading like wildfire'

350
00:28:48,024 --> 00:28:50,383
and it's already causing a
political storm in the state

351
00:28:50,384 --> 00:28:53,984
'Interim bail granted to
ex-Chief Minister Rajashekar'

352
00:28:56,785 --> 00:28:58,384
Bail is cleared, but...
- Yes, sir

353
00:28:58,825 --> 00:29:00,383
When's my son coming?

354
00:29:00,384 --> 00:29:01,383
He's coming tomorrow, sir

355
00:29:01,384 --> 00:29:04,265
All hail Mr. Rajashekar!

356
00:29:18,984 --> 00:29:20,905
Dhanush, go on

357
00:29:31,064 --> 00:29:32,304
Welcome, young man!

358
00:29:35,624 --> 00:29:38,304
Dhanush, how have you been?

359
00:29:38,704 --> 00:29:42,384
All these years,
not once did you call your aunt!

360
00:29:42,545 --> 00:29:43,424
Dhanush!

361
00:29:59,785 --> 00:30:01,064
Hey Dhanush!

362
00:30:01,785 --> 00:30:04,785
Been forever! Come on, let's chat

363
00:30:06,024 --> 00:30:07,545
You were the first ones to see him, right?

364
00:30:07,785 --> 00:30:08,865
Huh?!

365
00:30:12,344 --> 00:30:14,344
I mean, you saw him first
when he arrived here, no?

366
00:30:15,225 --> 00:30:17,465
Dhanush, go take some rest

367
00:30:27,944 --> 00:30:29,824
You're done with your business here, right?

368
00:30:29,825 --> 00:30:30,864
Call your driver and get going

369
00:30:30,865 --> 00:30:32,423
But, Uncle...

370
00:30:32,424 --> 00:30:33,184
Mmm!

371
00:30:33,185 --> 00:30:35,265
Okay, Brother, we'll leave

372
00:30:40,585 --> 00:30:42,145
Why did my brother do this?

373
00:30:42,505 --> 00:30:44,624
I guess he must've caught onto your plan

374
00:30:45,225 --> 00:30:46,544
Can't make sense of it

375
00:30:46,545 --> 00:30:47,663
Come on, Amma!

376
00:30:47,664 --> 00:30:49,063
We're not thumb-sucking babies

377
00:30:49,064 --> 00:30:50,505
We grew up in the same halls!

378
00:30:53,465 --> 00:30:54,664
Nambiar...
- Sir?

379
00:30:55,585 --> 00:30:57,304
Does this chair ring a bell?

380
00:30:57,505 --> 00:31:00,145
Your very first chair as CM

381
00:31:00,624 --> 00:31:01,744
Hmm

382
00:31:02,185 --> 00:31:05,185
No one should sit on this chair after me,
only I should

383
00:31:06,265 --> 00:31:08,785
That's why I brought it home
and kept it under my roof

384
00:31:09,865 --> 00:31:11,344
Giving up my power? Never

385
00:31:11,905 --> 00:31:17,265
I shouldn't have let these pests,
Poorna and Jana, into my home!

386
00:31:17,384 --> 00:31:19,744
Only when you lift a bucket
will you see its leaks

387
00:31:20,944 --> 00:31:24,105
Only when our foes stand before us
do their plans surface

388
00:31:26,064 --> 00:31:27,865
Let's wait till the elections are over, sir

389
00:31:28,145 --> 00:31:30,024
After that, we can work out something else

390
00:31:31,424 --> 00:31:32,505
Nambiar...

391
00:31:33,304 --> 00:31:35,185
Finally you brought my son Dhanush home!

392
00:31:49,145 --> 00:31:50,185
Pack your bags to India

393
00:31:50,344 --> 00:31:51,225
Why?

394
00:31:52,304 --> 00:31:53,384
To become CM

395
00:31:53,825 --> 00:31:55,024
It's your father's wish

396
00:31:55,944 --> 00:31:59,225
So my royal phase begins now, huh?

397
00:32:01,384 --> 00:32:02,664
What if I refuse to come?

398
00:32:03,505 --> 00:32:07,624
Your universal language "MONEY" will be cut off

399
00:32:08,785 --> 00:32:09,785
Uncs...

400
00:32:10,785 --> 00:32:12,664
Didn't expect you to throw that at me!

401
00:32:17,984 --> 00:32:18,664
Eh!

402
00:32:21,905 --> 00:32:24,064
I respectfully address you as my Uncle

403
00:32:24,704 --> 00:32:25,984
but what nerve to order me!

404
00:32:28,145 --> 00:32:29,744
You flew all the way here

405
00:32:30,465 --> 00:32:32,424
don't make it a coffin-ride back!

406
00:32:52,825 --> 00:32:53,865
'Krishna's Mess'

407
00:32:54,105 --> 00:32:55,064
'Food is God'

408
00:32:56,344 --> 00:32:57,265
'Kitchen'

409
00:32:58,585 --> 00:33:01,584
Bro, I've got a blockbuster
script ready for your boss

410
00:33:01,585 --> 00:33:06,584
How many ever crores it takes,
I'll produce it myself!

411
00:33:06,585 --> 00:33:07,824
Sir...

412
00:33:07,825 --> 00:33:09,344
Produce later, for now

413
00:33:09,545 --> 00:33:12,663
Four of you stuffed yourselves, right?

414
00:33:12,664 --> 00:33:13,784
Pay that bill first!

415
00:33:13,785 --> 00:33:15,504
If you don't pay up...

416
00:33:15,505 --> 00:33:18,265
I'll grab a stick from the kitchen and screw you...

417
00:33:19,265 --> 00:33:20,265
Right where it hurts!

418
00:33:20,465 --> 00:33:22,105
Haula Haula!

419
00:33:23,225 --> 00:33:24,904
All hail Sahasa Simha!

420
00:33:24,905 --> 00:33:26,343
All hail Abhinava Bhargava!

421
00:33:26,344 --> 00:33:28,023
All hail Jamindarru!

422
00:33:28,024 --> 00:33:29,584
Al hail Vishnu Dada!

423
00:33:29,585 --> 00:33:30,904
All hail Sahasa Simha!

424
00:33:30,905 --> 00:33:32,303
All hail Abhinava Bhargava!

425
00:33:32,304 --> 00:33:33,504
All hail Sahasa Simha!

426
00:33:33,505 --> 00:33:34,904
Aha! May none cast an evil eye!

427
00:33:34,905 --> 00:33:36,664
Krishna, you and your getup, superb!

428
00:33:37,145 --> 00:33:39,983
Served them nice-and-full, huh?

429
00:33:39,984 --> 00:33:43,584
Because of you, they're feasting free
and their bellies are on max!

430
00:33:43,585 --> 00:33:45,105
Hey kiddo!
- Yes Boss?

431
00:33:45,384 --> 00:33:49,584
Food offering is the highest form of charity!

432
00:33:49,585 --> 00:33:50,343
Correct!

433
00:33:50,344 --> 00:33:51,023
Ah, here he goes again!

434
00:33:51,024 --> 00:33:53,905
Even if the blessing of harvest wasn't ours

435
00:33:54,145 --> 00:33:56,344
God gave us the honor of offering it

436
00:33:57,024 --> 00:33:59,585
Let's work hard till we
have strength in our bodies

437
00:34:00,024 --> 00:34:01,585
Let's give generously!

438
00:34:02,064 --> 00:34:03,424
Keep the offerings coming!

439
00:34:03,664 --> 00:34:05,343
Eat up!
- Bravo!

440
00:34:05,344 --> 00:34:07,623
All hail Krishna Anna!

441
00:34:07,624 --> 00:34:09,224
BOSS!

442
00:34:09,225 --> 00:34:12,585
Your fan-base is already next level!

443
00:34:13,384 --> 00:34:14,664
Nani! Nani!

444
00:34:14,865 --> 00:34:16,465
This... This is all I need, bro!

445
00:34:16,744 --> 00:34:19,823
When the crowd whistles
and cheers for my acting in theaters

446
00:34:19,824 --> 00:34:21,383
the roof should blow off!
- It will!

447
00:34:21,384 --> 00:34:23,584
And I want a cutout of mine
in front of the theater!

448
00:34:23,585 --> 00:34:24,343
For sure!

449
00:34:24,344 --> 00:34:25,544
Nani...

450
00:34:25,545 --> 00:34:27,264
Every dialogue I deliver

451
00:34:27,465 --> 00:34:29,905
should make it to the back
of autos and cabs as slogans!

452
00:34:30,105 --> 00:34:32,184
This... this is all I want, bro!
- It will happen!

453
00:34:32,185 --> 00:34:33,904
Eyy, don't worry, Boss!

454
00:34:33,905 --> 00:34:36,704
From ladle to cutout,
what a jump it'll be!

455
00:34:37,984 --> 00:34:42,264
What's nice is that we haven't forgotten our
middle-class values and come to the market together

456
00:34:42,384 --> 00:34:44,465
Dear, I've been watching you

457
00:34:45,145 --> 00:34:48,824
You've been very dull
since coming back from London

458
00:34:49,944 --> 00:34:51,865
Any problem?

459
00:34:54,944 --> 00:34:55,905
Don't worry

460
00:34:56,465 --> 00:34:58,304
For every problem in front of you

461
00:34:58,825 --> 00:35:00,825
a solution is just behind

462
00:35:12,984 --> 00:35:15,704
Krishna, you're in original getup today,
what's the occasion?

463
00:35:16,064 --> 00:35:18,943
Listen! Half kilo cashew, 10 kilos sugar...

464
00:35:18,944 --> 00:35:20,743
And a sack of rice, please!
- Okay, Krishna

465
00:35:20,744 --> 00:35:24,304
Can you be yourself for
half an hour, at least?

466
00:35:24,465 --> 00:35:25,384
Ms. Rukku!

467
00:35:25,624 --> 00:35:28,825
The actor in me refuses to be
quiet even for ten minutes!

468
00:35:29,704 --> 00:35:30,663
Yeah, listen!

469
00:35:30,664 --> 00:35:33,224
10 kilos of Toor dal,
20 kilos of green gram, and Maida...

470
00:35:33,225 --> 00:35:34,943
'According to information we have'

471
00:35:34,944 --> 00:35:38,224
'Dhanush supposedly went
abroad for higher studies'

472
00:35:38,225 --> 00:35:40,784
'But which country did he
spend all these years in?'

473
00:35:40,785 --> 00:35:41,983
'And what his background is'

474
00:35:41,984 --> 00:35:43,944
'Is still a mystery'

475
00:35:44,265 --> 00:35:47,264
'And for all the questions
that bothers the common people'

476
00:35:47,265 --> 00:35:48,423
'only time holds the answer!'

477
00:35:48,424 --> 00:35:49,464
Boss!
- What else...

478
00:35:49,465 --> 00:35:50,585
Seriously, Boss!

479
00:35:51,185 --> 00:35:54,984
Look at you... from one angle, you look
like the CM's son Dhanush Rajashekar!

480
00:36:00,984 --> 00:36:02,545
Really?
- Check it out on the TV

481
00:36:05,545 --> 00:36:07,064
You're more or less like him

482
00:36:07,265 --> 00:36:08,184
Come on, Shiva!

483
00:36:08,185 --> 00:36:10,343
Thought you'd spot a star actor in me

484
00:36:10,344 --> 00:36:11,744
But nah... you saw a politician!

485
00:36:12,225 --> 00:36:13,023
Fine, anyways

486
00:36:13,024 --> 00:36:15,424
Your joy, my gain,
gimme 50% off!

487
00:36:15,585 --> 00:36:18,464
I just said 'politician' and you're already looting

488
00:36:18,465 --> 00:36:19,624
Hey Krishna!

489
00:36:19,825 --> 00:36:21,185
I was just kidding,
now pack everything

490
00:36:31,145 --> 00:36:32,063
See you later then!

491
00:36:32,064 --> 00:36:32,703
Okay, Krishna
- Bye!

492
00:36:32,704 --> 00:36:33,505
Bye, sis!

493
00:36:34,585 --> 00:36:35,663
Janaki...
- Huh?

494
00:36:35,664 --> 00:36:37,064
You go home, I'll come in a while

495
00:36:37,185 --> 00:36:38,063
Why, dear?

496
00:36:38,064 --> 00:36:39,105
Have some work, will come

497
00:37:20,105 --> 00:37:21,185
Uff!

498
00:37:21,384 --> 00:37:22,464
Sir, your order?

499
00:37:22,465 --> 00:37:23,544
Gimme a strong coffee

500
00:37:23,545 --> 00:37:24,744
One strong coffee!

501
00:37:25,304 --> 00:37:26,423
Ms. Rukku!
- Hmm?

502
00:37:26,424 --> 00:37:29,304
A little hair tweak backward,
I look like Dhanush Rajashekar, don't I?

503
00:37:29,624 --> 00:37:31,304
Ew! Not even close!

504
00:37:31,545 --> 00:37:32,505
One sec!

505
00:37:32,944 --> 00:37:33,744
Sir, coffee

506
00:37:41,785 --> 00:37:43,744
Now don't I look just like him?

507
00:37:43,944 --> 00:37:46,504
Just a touch more beard and 'stache

508
00:37:46,505 --> 00:37:48,624
you really pull him off, gotta say!

509
00:37:48,905 --> 00:37:50,343
Sir!
- Huh?

510
00:37:50,344 --> 00:37:51,185
One sec!

511
00:37:52,505 --> 00:37:55,023
Krishna's Mess, famous dish
Khara Uppsaaru, Mudde-bassaru

512
00:37:55,024 --> 00:37:56,023
What do you want?

513
00:37:56,024 --> 00:37:58,423
Along with mudde-bassaru,
your acting chops are famous too here, no?

514
00:37:58,424 --> 00:37:59,104
Ha!

515
00:37:59,105 --> 00:38:01,384
While the food's coming,
drop a punch dialogue, sir!

516
00:38:01,825 --> 00:38:02,904
Just wait!

517
00:38:02,905 --> 00:38:03,983
Sir!
- Huh?

518
00:38:03,984 --> 00:38:05,905
One Sangolli Rayanna's dialogue, sir!

519
00:38:06,105 --> 00:38:07,185
Sure, your highness!

520
00:38:07,465 --> 00:38:09,023
Hey Nani!
- Yes, your honour!

521
00:38:09,024 --> 00:38:10,505
Kindly accept your weapon

522
00:38:12,585 --> 00:38:13,905
'Hey Thackery!'

523
00:38:14,744 --> 00:38:18,384
'A stray like you won't understand
Kannadiga's pride and honor!'

524
00:38:18,825 --> 00:38:21,105
'A land untouched by fear'

525
00:38:21,304 --> 00:38:23,024
'a land of true valor'

526
00:38:23,185 --> 00:38:25,744
'where patriotism and honor reign,
the proud land of Kittur!'

527
00:38:26,384 --> 00:38:29,664
'And you dare bring terror
to this great land, huh?'

528
00:38:30,145 --> 00:38:32,185
'Looks like you don't care to live!'

529
00:38:32,384 --> 00:38:34,184
'And we don't care to spare your life either!'

530
00:38:34,185 --> 00:38:34,864
'You!'

531
00:38:34,865 --> 00:38:35,864
Yaaay!

532
00:38:35,865 --> 00:38:37,265
Superb, super!
- Vah vah!

533
00:38:39,624 --> 00:38:41,504
That was fire, Boss!

534
00:38:41,505 --> 00:38:43,584
That was suoer!
Hail Krishna boss!

535
00:38:43,585 --> 00:38:44,584
Are you seeing, ma'am?

536
00:38:44,585 --> 00:38:45,624
Super, Krishna! Super!

537
00:38:45,984 --> 00:38:49,144
But tell me, how long will you
just play dress-up like this?

538
00:38:49,145 --> 00:38:50,104
You've got the talent

539
00:38:50,105 --> 00:38:51,303
Just approach the right hand

540
00:38:51,304 --> 00:38:53,225
Definitely you'll get your shot in films

541
00:38:53,465 --> 00:38:55,864
Trust me, I've got a mole on my tongue!

542
00:38:55,865 --> 00:38:57,984
See, Ms. Rukku, I don't go
chasing after opportunity!

543
00:38:58,225 --> 00:39:00,184
Opportunity should come chasing after me!

544
00:39:00,185 --> 00:39:01,104
That's the real punch!

545
00:39:01,105 --> 00:39:02,024
Come again, what was that?

546
00:39:02,744 --> 00:39:03,983
Nothing, Ms. Rukku

547
00:39:03,984 --> 00:39:07,023
Lost it one day,
and swore on Goddess Annamma!

548
00:39:07,024 --> 00:39:09,384
That opportunity should find me,
and not the other way!

549
00:39:09,624 --> 00:39:13,024
My talent will make waves
in every lane of Gandhinagar

550
00:39:13,344 --> 00:39:17,264
One day for sure, some producer or director
will come knocking at my door!

551
00:39:17,265 --> 00:39:18,784
And hand me that chance!

552
00:39:18,785 --> 00:39:20,144
But how long...

553
00:39:20,145 --> 00:39:21,983
Ms. Rukku, mark my words

554
00:39:21,984 --> 00:39:24,304
One day for sure,
I'll become a HERO!

555
00:39:24,624 --> 00:39:26,943
And my cutout will make it
in front of the theater, no doubt!

556
00:39:26,944 --> 00:39:29,423
From ladle to cutout,
what a jump it'll be!

557
00:39:29,424 --> 00:39:30,144
Ah-ah!

558
00:39:30,145 --> 00:39:31,785
Oh, may it happen soon!

559
00:39:33,105 --> 00:39:35,465
'Should I feel glad my problem's sorted'

560
00:39:36,185 --> 00:39:39,865
'or fear that this temporary solution
is deadlier than the problem itself?'

561
00:39:40,465 --> 00:39:41,944
'No matter what happens'

562
00:39:42,704 --> 00:39:45,704
'I'll prove my Statesman game again!'

563
00:40:05,424 --> 00:40:06,624
Sir...

564
00:40:07,585 --> 00:40:08,865
You came...

565
00:40:09,424 --> 00:40:10,944
Made me hop into your car...

566
00:40:11,744 --> 00:40:13,384
Brought me here...

567
00:40:14,024 --> 00:40:15,383
And here...

568
00:40:15,384 --> 00:40:17,265
You've got stacks on stacks
of cash staring me down!

569
00:40:18,105 --> 00:40:19,944
I can't make sense of anything, sir!

570
00:40:20,384 --> 00:40:21,905
My name's Ananth Nambiar

571
00:40:22,944 --> 00:40:24,545
You know ex-CM Rajashekar

572
00:40:25,064 --> 00:40:26,785
I'm his adviser

573
00:40:27,585 --> 00:40:29,865
What did that grocery shop guy
say when he saw you?

574
00:40:30,704 --> 00:40:32,423
Uh, he said I looked like...

575
00:40:32,424 --> 00:40:34,825
He said you look just like
ex-CM Rajashekar's son

576
00:40:34,984 --> 00:40:35,943
Ha!

577
00:40:35,944 --> 00:40:37,785
Your dream is to become a hero, right?

578
00:40:38,185 --> 00:40:39,064
Yes, sir

579
00:40:39,225 --> 00:40:41,185
See that? Opportunity has come
looking for you on its own

580
00:40:42,105 --> 00:40:44,225
Uh, well...

581
00:40:44,505 --> 00:40:46,145
I get your doubt

582
00:40:47,624 --> 00:40:49,744
Yes, giving earns good karma

583
00:40:50,465 --> 00:40:52,383
But since I'm helping you

584
00:40:52,384 --> 00:40:55,664
Of course I expect something in return

585
00:40:57,465 --> 00:40:59,505
From now on... until I say otherwise

586
00:41:00,185 --> 00:41:02,825
You should act as Dhanush Rajashekar!

587
00:41:03,704 --> 00:41:05,064
Dhanush Rajashekar, huh?

588
00:41:05,465 --> 00:41:06,984
You mean in real life, sir?

589
00:41:07,344 --> 00:41:08,424
Yes

590
00:41:09,225 --> 00:41:11,905
The more you act and impress people

591
00:41:12,664 --> 00:41:16,265
bigger the budget of the movie
you'll star in as a hero

592
00:41:17,225 --> 00:41:19,465
But he's already there in real life, no?

593
00:41:21,265 --> 00:41:23,383
I don't like being asked too many questions

594
00:41:23,384 --> 00:41:24,384
Uh...

595
00:41:25,744 --> 00:41:26,624
Hmm

596
00:41:27,145 --> 00:41:29,825
Do you want an answer to your question,
or wings for your dreams?

597
00:41:34,505 --> 00:41:36,905
Take this as a challenge and act it out

598
00:41:37,744 --> 00:41:39,905
then you'll become the 'Challenging Star'

599
00:41:40,384 --> 00:41:41,224
Correct, sir!

600
00:41:41,225 --> 00:41:42,224
You're absolutely correct, sir!

601
00:41:42,225 --> 00:41:43,703
My Rukku used to tell me the same thing, sir

602
00:41:43,704 --> 00:41:45,343
That I'd become a big hero one day!

603
00:41:45,344 --> 00:41:47,184
Acting? Don't worry, sir!

604
00:41:47,185 --> 00:41:48,423
In-built app for me!

605
00:41:48,424 --> 00:41:49,904
I'll whip it up and mouth it like a boss!

606
00:41:49,905 --> 00:41:50,905
Sir...

607
00:41:51,145 --> 00:41:52,943
You'll make me a hero... right, uh?

608
00:41:52,944 --> 00:41:54,623
Do what I say, and consider it done!

609
00:41:54,624 --> 00:41:56,343
A big yes to whatever you ask of me, sir!

610
00:41:56,344 --> 00:41:58,063
From now on, you're the remote, I'm the toy

611
00:41:58,064 --> 00:41:59,384
I'll move as you command!

612
00:41:59,825 --> 00:42:00,584
Oh one sec!

613
00:42:00,585 --> 00:42:01,983
Hey, gimme your phone!

614
00:42:01,984 --> 00:42:04,504
Sir, it's my buddy Nani
He'll be over the moon if he hears this!

615
00:42:04,505 --> 00:42:05,624
I said, gimme that!

616
00:42:06,664 --> 00:42:07,744
Answer it

617
00:42:08,785 --> 00:42:10,145
Yes, sir
- Put it on speaker

618
00:42:10,865 --> 00:42:11,744
Hello...

619
00:42:11,905 --> 00:42:13,104
Hello, Boss!

620
00:42:13,105 --> 00:42:14,865
Listen, tell him exactly what I say

621
00:42:15,304 --> 00:42:16,984
Tell him you got a movie offer

622
00:42:17,225 --> 00:42:19,224
and you're off to Bombay
and won't be back for 6 months

623
00:42:19,225 --> 00:42:20,063
Hello...

624
00:42:20,064 --> 00:42:21,264
Boss, can you hear me?

625
00:42:21,265 --> 00:42:22,144
Hello...

626
00:42:22,145 --> 00:42:23,743
Yo buddy Nani!

627
00:42:23,744 --> 00:42:25,383
Hero gig in the bag, man!

628
00:42:25,384 --> 00:42:26,504
I'm off to Bombay

629
00:42:26,505 --> 00:42:28,585
Will be back in 6 months, got it?

630
00:42:28,944 --> 00:42:32,064
Two days without Rukku sis...
and what nonsense are you talking?

631
00:42:32,304 --> 00:42:33,144
Eyy, forget that!

632
00:42:33,145 --> 00:42:35,185
Tomorrow's chutney, you grind or I do?

633
00:42:35,304 --> 00:42:37,063
Swear on my mess, man, truth!

634
00:42:37,064 --> 00:42:39,545
Are you serious, Boss?

635
00:42:39,744 --> 00:42:40,865
Oh God!

636
00:42:41,024 --> 00:42:42,865
I'm losing it with happiness!

637
00:42:43,424 --> 00:42:44,464
Okay then...

638
00:42:44,465 --> 00:42:47,383
So, what happens to me and
the mess from tomorrow?

639
00:42:47,384 --> 00:42:48,265
Uh...

640
00:42:48,505 --> 00:42:51,184
Tell him to shut down the mess, go back to
the village and return only when you're back

641
00:42:51,185 --> 00:42:51,784
Ah!

642
00:42:51,785 --> 00:42:53,264
Boss, you there or already off to Bombay?

643
00:42:53,265 --> 00:42:54,704
Buddy, do one thing

644
00:42:54,825 --> 00:42:56,943
Close down the mess
and go back to the village

645
00:42:56,944 --> 00:42:57,505
Okay

646
00:42:57,664 --> 00:42:59,584
After I return, I'll call you

647
00:42:59,585 --> 00:43:00,824
Oh, and one favor!
- Yeah, tell me

648
00:43:00,825 --> 00:43:02,104
There's cash in the rice box

649
00:43:02,105 --> 00:43:04,663
Keep a part for yourself
and hand some to Rangamma

650
00:43:04,664 --> 00:43:05,264
Got it?

651
00:43:05,265 --> 00:43:06,224
A-All the best, Boss!

652
00:43:06,225 --> 00:43:06,905
Ha!

653
00:43:09,865 --> 00:43:10,785
Krishna...

654
00:43:11,664 --> 00:43:13,225
Listen up properly

655
00:43:14,944 --> 00:43:17,225
Today is your last day as Krishna

656
00:43:23,185 --> 00:43:24,743
The second you leave this place...

657
00:43:24,744 --> 00:43:25,983
I'm Dhanush Rajashekar!

658
00:43:25,984 --> 00:43:26,984
Got it, sir!

659
00:43:27,105 --> 00:43:29,544
Sir, can I call my Rukku just once?

660
00:43:29,545 --> 00:43:30,505
If she hears this...

661
00:43:32,185 --> 00:43:33,344
Remember what you told me

662
00:43:33,664 --> 00:43:35,545
I'm the remote, you're the toy

663
00:43:36,105 --> 00:43:37,384
You act on my word!

664
00:43:40,105 --> 00:43:45,424
'From now on, people must say,
Dhanush means Leader, Leader means Dhanush'

665
00:43:45,785 --> 00:43:47,225
'I'll get you ready like that'

666
00:44:44,344 --> 00:44:46,185
Oh my my my!

667
00:44:46,505 --> 00:44:48,343
What's this, sir?

668
00:44:48,344 --> 00:44:49,624
Is this a house or a palace?

669
00:44:49,785 --> 00:44:51,584
Just say the word,
and I'll turn it into a top-class mess

670
00:44:51,585 --> 00:44:53,664
Hey! Why the hell did you fall at the CM's feet?

671
00:44:53,905 --> 00:44:54,784
Come on, sir!

672
00:44:54,785 --> 00:44:57,784
It's my first time seeing the CM up close!

673
00:44:57,785 --> 00:45:00,104
Didn't know what to do in hurry-burry

674
00:45:00,105 --> 00:45:01,023
so just dropped at his feet!

675
00:45:01,024 --> 00:45:03,303
If it was his son,
he'd have done the same, no?

676
00:45:03,304 --> 00:45:05,504
No! Dhanush isn't that type

677
00:45:05,505 --> 00:45:06,225
Ohhh!

678
00:45:06,344 --> 00:45:08,743
This fortress of guards and walls,
what do you think it means?

679
00:45:08,744 --> 00:45:12,145
Hmm! It feels like all the
public money is with politicians

680
00:45:12,424 --> 00:45:13,304
Joke, huh?

681
00:45:14,304 --> 00:45:18,784
In this house with endless rooms,
with security so tight, even air can't escape

682
00:45:18,785 --> 00:45:20,465
and I've got you here

683
00:45:21,344 --> 00:45:24,185
do you get how serious
it is to act as Dhanush?

684
00:45:24,545 --> 00:45:25,465
Ohhh!

685
00:45:25,785 --> 00:45:26,663
Uh...

686
00:45:26,664 --> 00:45:28,585
(Phone ringing)

687
00:45:29,505 --> 00:45:31,184
- Hello, Rukku...
- Krishna

688
00:45:31,185 --> 00:45:33,184
I'll be at your mess in half an hour

689
00:45:33,185 --> 00:45:33,784
Come over

690
00:45:33,785 --> 00:45:34,383
I'm actually...

691
00:45:34,384 --> 00:45:35,545
Hey! No phone!

692
00:45:35,664 --> 00:45:36,943
Drop it!
- Sir, it's my Rukku

693
00:45:36,944 --> 00:45:38,784
Drop it now! Give me that!
- Sir, just once...

694
00:45:38,785 --> 00:45:40,464
Sir! Sir! Sir!

695
00:45:40,465 --> 00:45:41,785
How did you even get this phone?

696
00:45:41,944 --> 00:45:44,943
Split-second swipe from your pocket, sir!

697
00:45:44,944 --> 00:45:46,063
Swipe, huh?

698
00:45:46,064 --> 00:45:47,585
Uh.. lifted it, sir!

699
00:45:47,744 --> 00:45:48,703
What do you mean lifted...

700
00:45:48,704 --> 00:45:49,504
Relax, sir

701
00:45:49,505 --> 00:45:52,224
In simple language, I stole it, sir

702
00:45:52,225 --> 00:45:53,904
Sir.. sir.. sir, please!

703
00:45:53,905 --> 00:45:55,584
One call to Rukku, that's all I ask, sir!

704
00:45:55,585 --> 00:45:56,743
After that, I'm all yours!
- No, no!

705
00:45:56,744 --> 00:45:57,423
NO!

706
00:45:57,424 --> 00:45:58,744
Sir.. sir.. sir.. Please!
- Look!

707
00:45:59,465 --> 00:46:01,545
Hero or phone call,
which one's your priority?

708
00:46:02,105 --> 00:46:03,145
Uff!

709
00:46:03,825 --> 00:46:05,465
Only if I become a hero, sir

710
00:46:05,744 --> 00:46:08,384
can I go to Rukku's mother
and ask for her hand in marriage

711
00:46:08,744 --> 00:46:10,905
And for that, you follow MY orders!

712
00:46:11,145 --> 00:46:12,105
Last warning!

713
00:46:12,344 --> 00:46:13,904
If this repeats

714
00:46:13,905 --> 00:46:15,824
forget your dream of becoming a hero!

715
00:46:15,825 --> 00:46:17,064
Got it?

716
00:46:18,145 --> 00:46:19,344
Krishna!

717
00:46:19,585 --> 00:46:20,505
Krishna!

718
00:46:20,785 --> 00:46:21,865
Nani!

719
00:46:59,505 --> 00:47:01,544
Uncle, gimme a quarter bottle of RS!

720
00:47:01,545 --> 00:47:03,824
Damn you! Calling me Uncle?

721
00:47:03,825 --> 00:47:05,144
I'm your classmate, you know!

722
00:47:05,145 --> 00:47:09,104
CBI Shankar's all ego,
no buddy love or possessive crap!

723
00:47:09,105 --> 00:47:10,464
I'll give you a proper slippering, you rascal!

724
00:47:10,465 --> 00:47:13,264
You go around fooling everyone with that fake ID

725
00:47:13,265 --> 00:47:15,104
I don't have time to argue, Uncle

726
00:47:15,105 --> 00:47:16,423
Interview's waiting, so please!

727
00:47:16,424 --> 00:47:19,865
Drunk to an interview?
Who'll hire you?!

728
00:47:20,064 --> 00:47:21,984
Takes nerve to face an interview, you know!

729
00:47:22,105 --> 00:47:23,624
Alright, drink up and get the hell out!
- Thank you

730
00:47:25,825 --> 00:47:27,264
Anna!

731
00:47:27,265 --> 00:47:30,703
No matter what anyone says,
you're not dead!

732
00:47:30,704 --> 00:47:33,424
It's confirmed, you've gone for shoot!

733
00:47:34,024 --> 00:47:35,063
Anna!

734
00:47:35,064 --> 00:47:37,545
Anna, I'm talking to you
and you're just walking off!

735
00:47:39,905 --> 00:47:41,784
Hey Krishna, stop!

736
00:47:41,785 --> 00:47:42,743
You! Stop!

737
00:47:42,744 --> 00:47:44,544
KRISHNA! I said STOP! Don't run

738
00:47:44,545 --> 00:47:46,304
Ambi Anna!

739
00:47:47,905 --> 00:47:49,824
KRISHNA, stop!

740
00:47:49,825 --> 00:47:51,585
Listen, I said STOP!

741
00:47:51,825 --> 00:47:53,265
Stop! Don't run!

742
00:47:57,865 --> 00:48:02,905
Knew it, Anna! You're on set shooting, go on!

743
00:48:04,624 --> 00:48:05,423
Anna!

744
00:48:05,424 --> 00:48:06,423
It's you!

745
00:48:06,424 --> 00:48:07,664
Ma'am! Kanwar!

746
00:48:09,865 --> 00:48:11,144
'You mongrel!'

747
00:48:11,145 --> 00:48:14,265
'Not Kanwar, call me Kanwar Lal!'

748
00:48:15,585 --> 00:48:18,504
You fatsoes! Stop gawking! Rough him up!

749
00:48:18,505 --> 00:48:19,663
Sorry, ma'am!

750
00:48:19,664 --> 00:48:21,544
He's in Ambi Anna's getup!

751
00:48:21,545 --> 00:48:22,544
No way!

752
00:48:22,545 --> 00:48:23,703
No chance!

753
00:48:23,704 --> 00:48:24,904
You scoundrels!

754
00:48:24,905 --> 00:48:27,023
Why chase him all the way here then?

755
00:48:27,024 --> 00:48:29,864
Ma'am, check out his look!

756
00:48:29,865 --> 00:48:30,983
Aiyo Uppi sir!

757
00:48:30,984 --> 00:48:32,144
Uppi sir!

758
00:48:32,145 --> 00:48:35,624
From behind, those curls had us
thinking it was Sadhu Kokila!

759
00:48:35,785 --> 00:48:37,784
Damn you! That's only a getup!

760
00:48:37,785 --> 00:48:39,703
Side please! Shooting's happening here!

761
00:48:39,704 --> 00:48:41,825
Phones off! Silence, please!

762
00:48:42,105 --> 00:48:43,505
Which shooting, bro?

763
00:48:45,304 --> 00:48:46,343
Come here!

764
00:48:46,344 --> 00:48:47,744
You moron!

765
00:48:48,225 --> 00:48:51,743
If Uppi sir's direction,
it's gotta be Antha Part 3!

766
00:48:51,744 --> 00:48:53,224
You drunkard!

767
00:48:53,225 --> 00:48:54,784
If this is a shoot,
where's the camera?

768
00:48:54,785 --> 00:48:57,024
I'll give ya a damn thrashing!

769
00:48:57,304 --> 00:48:59,265
Tech's advanced now

770
00:48:59,384 --> 00:49:01,303
Camera can be anywhere!

771
00:49:01,304 --> 00:49:04,225
Ma'am, forget the getup!

772
00:49:05,064 --> 00:49:06,744
He's a six-and-a-half-foot giant

773
00:49:08,424 --> 00:49:11,105
Forget beating,
one sneeze from him and we're finished!

774
00:49:11,545 --> 00:49:14,383
Our limit's 3-4 feet for roughing someone up

775
00:49:14,384 --> 00:49:15,904
If anyone's in that range, we'll do the job

776
00:49:15,905 --> 00:49:18,063
Otherwise, deal's off! Come on, guys, move!

777
00:49:18,064 --> 00:49:19,224
Where the hell are you guys going?

778
00:49:19,225 --> 00:49:20,265
Damn her!
- Stop, I say!

779
00:49:20,944 --> 00:49:23,384
My dream of becoming an actor
and Ambareesh Anna getup

780
00:49:23,664 --> 00:49:25,105
saved my skin today!

781
00:49:25,465 --> 00:49:26,465
Thank you, Boss!

782
00:49:27,185 --> 00:49:28,824
Hey! Where the hell are you going?

783
00:49:28,825 --> 00:49:29,743
GIVE ME MY MONEY!

784
00:49:29,744 --> 00:49:30,704
Gimme Gimme!

785
00:49:32,744 --> 00:49:33,704
Ms. Rukku!

786
00:49:34,024 --> 00:49:35,744
I'll be a star in the future!

787
00:49:36,185 --> 00:49:39,865
Seizing me out here on the road,
do you think that's right?

788
00:49:40,185 --> 00:49:41,384
You want your money, right?

789
00:49:41,905 --> 00:49:44,184
Come to the mess,
I'll square up every single rupee!

790
00:49:44,185 --> 00:49:45,584
You sure you'll pay up?
- Yeah, come on

791
00:49:45,585 --> 00:49:46,304
Hmm

792
00:49:48,024 --> 00:49:49,265
'You mongrel!'

793
00:49:53,585 --> 00:49:55,024
Take your money, count it!

794
00:49:56,624 --> 00:49:58,225
'Who the crap wants it?'
- One, two...

795
00:49:58,424 --> 00:49:59,624
'Who the crap wants it?'
- Three, four...

796
00:50:00,384 --> 00:50:02,023
'Moral obligation, my foot!'

797
00:50:02,024 --> 00:50:02,623
Ah...

798
00:50:02,624 --> 00:50:03,984
This is just the interest!
And the main sum...

799
00:50:14,624 --> 00:50:17,024
Arey! New getup already?!

800
00:50:18,465 --> 00:50:21,545
Changing looks and layers
every freakin' second!

801
00:50:22,664 --> 00:50:25,865
Haven't seen the real you at all!

802
00:50:26,585 --> 00:50:30,904
Hot day out, have some tea
or chilled buttermilk, and relax

803
00:50:30,905 --> 00:50:31,584
Nani!

804
00:50:31,585 --> 00:50:33,944
Why Nani? You go get it!

805
00:50:34,225 --> 00:50:35,225
Huh? Ha!

806
00:50:40,064 --> 00:50:41,343
Nani...
- Hmm?

807
00:50:41,344 --> 00:50:42,304
Go, bro!

808
00:50:42,704 --> 00:50:44,944
Go give Rukku her tea

809
00:50:45,145 --> 00:50:47,664
Why? She won't sip if you hand it over?

810
00:50:47,785 --> 00:50:49,024
Not that, bro!

811
00:50:49,145 --> 00:50:52,384
Miss "Interest",
always on my case for the due!

812
00:50:52,585 --> 00:50:54,024
Which due, bro?

813
00:50:54,145 --> 00:50:57,063
All cleared, nothing pending!

814
00:50:57,064 --> 00:50:58,145
Really?
- Yep!

815
00:50:58,424 --> 00:51:01,825
You know I'm a bit weak with numbers!

816
00:51:01,944 --> 00:51:04,544
Not numbers!
You're weak when it comes to Rukku!

817
00:51:04,545 --> 00:51:07,784
That girl sits there,
sipping tea, gazing at you!

818
00:51:07,785 --> 00:51:10,464
And you, stand here making tea
and gazing right back at her!

819
00:51:10,465 --> 00:51:12,104
If it's love, just confess!

820
00:51:12,105 --> 00:51:14,703
Quit all this over-the-top drama!

821
00:51:14,704 --> 00:51:17,984
You know my scene!
No cash, no stash, nothing to spare

822
00:51:19,024 --> 00:51:22,265
What if I go propose to her
after I become a big hero?

823
00:51:22,424 --> 00:51:24,545
What if you get age-barred by then?

824
00:51:25,265 --> 00:51:27,185
Every day some prospective groom
comes to check her out!

825
00:51:27,344 --> 00:51:30,465
You should be sweating in the room,
not by the stove

826
00:51:31,905 --> 00:51:33,024
What to do now...

827
00:51:34,465 --> 00:51:36,225
That girl shouldn't marry anyone else

828
00:51:36,585 --> 00:51:39,743
She'll wait till you become a hero
I'll make sure of it!

829
00:51:39,744 --> 00:51:40,464
Ah!

830
00:51:40,465 --> 00:51:42,225
Close that mouth,
or a fly might sneak in!

831
00:51:43,185 --> 00:51:45,704
What's up? Your boss is looking all handsome!

832
00:51:46,545 --> 00:51:48,664
My boss is not just a charmer

833
00:51:48,984 --> 00:51:51,024
He's so generous, even the greatest
giver Karna will fall short!

834
00:51:51,545 --> 00:51:53,744
One slap on his thigh,
even Bheema goes dummy

835
00:51:54,545 --> 00:51:56,545
Don't get me wrong, just saying

836
00:51:56,905 --> 00:52:02,105
At your age, you should be rocking babies,
not chasing grooms and weddings!

837
00:52:02,744 --> 00:52:04,185
You bloody!

838
00:52:04,304 --> 00:52:07,063
Your boss wants to be a hero at an age
when he should be a father

839
00:52:07,064 --> 00:52:07,983
You cool with that?

840
00:52:07,984 --> 00:52:09,704
N-No... B-But.. Boss!

841
00:52:10,105 --> 00:52:11,704
Ms. Rukku, wait!
- Come here fast!

842
00:52:11,905 --> 00:52:12,585
Boss...

843
00:52:12,744 --> 00:52:14,023
Ms. Rukku, hold on, one sec

844
00:52:14,024 --> 00:52:15,064
What's the issue huh?

845
00:52:15,225 --> 00:52:18,303
Is the tea missing sugar, missing milk,
or is the tea itself messed up?

846
00:52:18,304 --> 00:52:19,585
What you're doing isn't right, Krishna!

847
00:52:19,825 --> 00:52:21,864
You asked me to come to the mess
to clear my account

848
00:52:21,865 --> 00:52:23,664
in full-on 'Sampathige Savaal' style

849
00:52:24,024 --> 00:52:26,344
Where's the sum you owe me?
Come on, hand it out!

850
00:52:27,105 --> 00:52:29,424
Yeah, that's 'Sampathige Savaal' line

851
00:52:29,905 --> 00:52:31,505
but... the scene now

852
00:52:31,865 --> 00:52:33,544
is full-on 'Kasturi Nivasa' climax!

853
00:52:33,545 --> 00:52:34,824
Just gimme few more days

854
00:52:34,825 --> 00:52:36,545
I'll clear everything!
- Ohh God!

855
00:52:36,905 --> 00:52:39,104
I'm fed up with giving you time
again and again

856
00:52:39,105 --> 00:52:41,624
Don't see you clearing your dues ever

857
00:52:42,225 --> 00:52:43,465
- Do one thing
- Hmm

858
00:52:43,585 --> 00:52:46,464
From tomorrow, join me for finance collection

859
00:52:46,465 --> 00:52:48,265
And I'll personally scratch off your dues

860
00:52:48,424 --> 00:52:49,824
Oh, clever plan!

861
00:52:49,825 --> 00:52:50,865
Uh, Boss!

862
00:52:51,145 --> 00:52:52,464
What sis is saying makes sense!

863
00:52:52,465 --> 00:52:55,585
Having a man by her side
makes collection safe and easy

864
00:52:55,825 --> 00:52:56,663
Right, sis?

865
00:52:56,664 --> 00:52:59,105
Uh, alright, Rukku!

866
00:53:13,064 --> 00:53:16,865
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

867
00:53:16,984 --> 00:53:20,384
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

868
00:53:20,865 --> 00:53:27,944
"Quietly sweet,
the moments we share together"

869
00:53:36,424 --> 00:53:44,105
"In your eyes,
I see the goodness of our roots"

870
00:53:44,304 --> 00:53:48,184
"So much I want to say"

871
00:53:48,185 --> 00:53:51,904
"In front of you, I lose what to say"

872
00:53:51,905 --> 00:53:55,384
"Something stirs within"

873
00:53:56,624 --> 00:53:59,624
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

874
00:54:00,424 --> 00:54:03,504
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

875
00:54:03,505 --> 00:54:10,704
"Quietly sweet,
the moments we share together"

876
00:54:11,225 --> 00:54:18,944
"No one has ever haunted me,
the way your beautiful heart does"

877
00:54:47,545 --> 00:54:49,424
She's really intelligent, this bride
- Oh really?

878
00:54:49,944 --> 00:54:50,864
My daughter...

879
00:54:50,865 --> 00:54:52,465
Son, take a good look at your bride

880
00:54:56,664 --> 00:54:59,145
If the horoscopes match,
we'll fix the wedding

881
00:55:07,024 --> 00:55:08,504
Krishna, what's today's special?

882
00:55:08,505 --> 00:55:10,544
Krishna's mess, famous dish...

883
00:55:10,545 --> 00:55:12,504
Khara Uppsaaru, Mudde-bassaru!

884
00:55:12,505 --> 00:55:16,383
"You make me forget the work I do"

885
00:55:16,384 --> 00:55:19,704
"You hold that enchanting spell"

886
00:55:20,185 --> 00:55:24,063
"I've learned a world of things from you"

887
00:55:24,064 --> 00:55:27,184
"And yet there's still so much left"

888
00:55:27,185 --> 00:55:30,744
"With a heart full, how could I resist you?"

889
00:55:30,944 --> 00:55:34,864
"Playful and sly, my teen-like heart"

890
00:55:34,865 --> 00:55:38,584
"Close together, just like now"

891
00:55:38,585 --> 00:55:42,465
"Feels as if heaven stands before my eyes"

892
00:55:43,624 --> 00:55:46,664
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

893
00:55:47,424 --> 00:55:50,504
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

894
00:55:50,505 --> 00:55:57,424
"Quietly sweet,
the moments we share together"

895
00:55:58,185 --> 00:56:05,744
"Each day I rise, longing to behold you"

896
00:56:46,024 --> 00:56:48,145
Is it true, what I heard, my child?

897
00:56:48,384 --> 00:56:49,584
About Krishna, you mean?

898
00:56:49,585 --> 00:56:50,184
Hmm

899
00:56:50,185 --> 00:56:51,063
Yeah, true

900
00:56:51,064 --> 00:56:52,585
I'm in love with Krishna

901
00:56:52,744 --> 00:56:54,225
and I want to marry him only

902
00:56:54,545 --> 00:56:57,505
You know Krishna's best quality, Appa? Humanity

903
00:56:57,664 --> 00:57:01,864
Whoever who comes to his mess, whether
they can afford or not, he feeds them full

904
00:57:01,865 --> 00:57:02,983
I see!

905
00:57:02,984 --> 00:57:06,865
Krishna borrowed that money from me to
fund his mess worker Rangamma's son

906
00:57:07,304 --> 00:57:08,905
Whatever you convince, dear

907
00:57:09,744 --> 00:57:13,144
He's short on "Vitamin M", isn't he?

908
00:57:13,145 --> 00:57:15,624
Father, I don't want an Ambani or Adani

909
00:57:15,785 --> 00:57:19,264
I want someone people would go crazy for,
screaming, 'Anna, I'm your fan'

910
00:57:19,265 --> 00:57:20,744
That's the kind of guy, my Krishna is!

911
00:57:20,905 --> 00:57:24,585
"You wish me a colourful life"

912
00:57:24,825 --> 00:57:28,105
"But, is there anything more colourful than you?"

913
00:57:28,744 --> 00:57:32,465
"The moments with you are purest bliss"

914
00:57:32,585 --> 00:57:35,623
"is there any joy that beats this?"

915
00:57:35,624 --> 00:57:39,225
"I'm no poet to pen words at will"

916
00:57:39,384 --> 00:57:43,105
"Life's own schooling is enough to live today"

917
00:57:43,225 --> 00:57:46,905
"Together, no time could ever be enough"

918
00:57:47,064 --> 00:57:51,145
"Past every limit, why count the hours at all?"

919
00:57:51,944 --> 00:57:55,225
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

920
00:57:55,785 --> 00:57:58,744
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

921
00:58:06,664 --> 00:58:09,624
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

922
00:58:10,384 --> 00:58:13,465
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

923
00:58:14,304 --> 00:58:17,344
"Your eternal name I chant, Krishna, O' Krishna"

924
00:58:20,905 --> 00:58:23,105
Rukku, get ready early tomorrow

925
00:58:23,545 --> 00:58:25,265
Is some groom visiting me?

926
00:58:25,624 --> 00:58:27,105
Your engagement is tomorrow

927
00:58:27,704 --> 00:58:30,225
Mother, I don't even know the groom

928
00:58:30,344 --> 00:58:31,743
haven't even seen him!

929
00:58:31,744 --> 00:58:32,865
How can I just agree?

930
00:58:33,225 --> 00:58:37,024
The groom's better than the one you
picked yourself, and he earns well

931
00:58:37,984 --> 00:58:39,905
Mother, this can't go the way you want

932
00:58:41,585 --> 00:58:45,624
Just to marry that mess guy
you tampered with the horoscope

933
00:58:45,744 --> 00:58:48,145
Don't think I don't know your games

934
00:58:48,384 --> 00:58:51,904
No way that dress-up guy
becomes this family's son-in-law!

935
00:58:51,905 --> 00:58:53,145
Uh...
- Oh!

936
00:58:53,265 --> 00:58:54,984
Oh, so you already dug up all the info!

937
00:58:55,825 --> 00:58:57,545
Not another word,
just do as I say

938
00:58:57,704 --> 00:59:01,304
Or else, the door's open,
feel free to leave!

939
00:59:01,624 --> 00:59:02,544
Alamelu!

940
00:59:02,545 --> 00:59:03,423
You shut up!

941
00:59:03,424 --> 00:59:04,424
Don't say a word!

942
00:59:04,704 --> 00:59:06,423
Seenu, you be quiet

943
00:59:06,424 --> 00:59:07,905
Don't get scolded because of me

944
00:59:08,145 --> 00:59:09,024
I'll leave, don't fuss

945
00:59:09,465 --> 00:59:10,983
Where will you go, child?

946
00:59:10,984 --> 00:59:12,144
Please listen!
- Hey!

947
00:59:12,145 --> 00:59:13,063
Go on!

948
00:59:13,064 --> 00:59:15,584
You'll learn it the hard way!
- Please, just listen to me, my child!

949
00:59:15,585 --> 00:59:16,784
Where will you go, huh?

950
00:59:16,785 --> 00:59:19,024
To Krishna! I want to be with him

951
00:59:19,304 --> 00:59:21,624
Child, it's not that easy

952
00:59:21,905 --> 00:59:24,663
You know your mother's temper

953
00:59:24,664 --> 00:59:27,344
Oh yeah? Only mom's got temper, I don't huh?

954
00:59:27,624 --> 00:59:28,943
Don't leave the house, my dear!

955
00:59:28,944 --> 00:59:29,663
Yeah, prove it!

956
00:59:29,664 --> 00:59:31,784
Life isn't as easy as back-answering your mother!

957
00:59:31,785 --> 00:59:33,544
One day when things go wrong

958
00:59:33,545 --> 00:59:36,105
you'll know why I raised a ruckus!
- Alamelu!

959
00:59:36,664 --> 00:59:38,023
My Krishna's not that type of guy

960
00:59:38,024 --> 00:59:42,703
I'll marry him and live so well,
even you'll admit he's the perfect son-in-law

961
00:59:42,704 --> 00:59:44,584
C-Child, listen for a second

962
00:59:44,585 --> 00:59:46,185
Seenu, you don't worry

963
00:59:46,304 --> 00:59:48,023
Krishna will take care of me like a queen

964
00:59:48,024 --> 00:59:49,024
Oh yeah? Dream on!

965
00:59:49,344 --> 00:59:52,704
Krishna, I'll be at your mess
in half an hour, come over

966
00:59:58,505 --> 00:59:59,624
Stop, right here

967
01:00:15,225 --> 01:00:17,104
Come on, child
- Ohhh!

968
01:00:17,105 --> 01:00:19,464
Why now? Huh? Whyyyy?

969
01:00:19,465 --> 01:00:22,343
You had the nerve to tell me you'd marry him

970
01:00:22,344 --> 01:00:23,743
why are you back now, huh?

971
01:00:23,744 --> 01:00:26,824
Alamelu! I beg you!
Please, give her some peace!

972
01:00:26,825 --> 01:00:29,023
She's already suffered enough

973
01:00:29,024 --> 01:00:30,343
Come on, go inside, child
- Ohhh!

974
01:00:30,344 --> 01:00:31,584
Go on
- Aiyo!

975
01:00:31,585 --> 01:00:34,704
Why? Did your dearest Krishna
back off on you?

976
01:00:34,984 --> 01:00:36,264
I knew it!

977
01:00:36,265 --> 01:00:39,544
Trusting that flashy makeup
fellow would get you here!

978
01:00:39,545 --> 01:00:41,545
Now see, she wanted to prove me wrong!

979
01:00:42,265 --> 01:00:44,145
Why... why would you do this?

980
01:00:44,744 --> 01:00:46,505
Where are you, Krishna?

981
01:01:04,185 --> 01:01:06,465
Oh my my my!
What's all this, sir?

982
01:01:07,024 --> 01:01:09,063
I only wished for one cutout

983
01:01:09,064 --> 01:01:11,703
but you've gone all out and
made it a whole procession of me!

984
01:01:11,704 --> 01:01:13,303
Oh my! Thank you so much, sir!

985
01:01:13,304 --> 01:01:14,865
Thank you, sir!
- Look who's big shot!

986
01:01:15,145 --> 01:01:17,505
Out of excitement, don't forget
the speech I've prepped for you

987
01:01:17,984 --> 01:01:18,943
Sir!

988
01:01:18,944 --> 01:01:21,264
Just wait till I step on the stage!

989
01:01:21,265 --> 01:01:24,144
I'll deliver word for word,
exactly as you gave it

990
01:01:24,145 --> 01:01:26,504
And with full acting, huh!

991
01:01:26,505 --> 01:01:27,785
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

992
01:01:27,905 --> 01:01:29,784
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

993
01:01:29,785 --> 01:01:33,905
All hail Karunaada People's Party!

994
01:01:35,984 --> 01:01:37,664
Uncle...
- Hmm-hmm

995
01:01:37,785 --> 01:01:39,905
Both of you, sit there... go

996
01:01:40,344 --> 01:01:41,545
You come, my son

997
01:01:48,944 --> 01:01:49,865
Damn it!

998
01:01:59,185 --> 01:02:03,105
To all the beloved citizens of Mysore,
my highest greetings!

999
01:02:04,064 --> 01:02:07,265
I am forever in your debt
for your love and support

1000
01:02:07,785 --> 01:02:09,944
I say this, bowing to your feet

1001
01:02:10,304 --> 01:02:13,545
I have done no wrong,
nor will I in the future

1002
01:02:14,105 --> 01:02:16,105
For I am a true son of this soil

1003
01:02:16,905 --> 01:02:19,704
I have no regrets over losing the CM chair

1004
01:02:20,024 --> 01:02:22,185
But one thing haunts me

1005
01:02:22,344 --> 01:02:26,664
the chance to serve the poor
and dalits was snatched away

1006
01:02:27,185 --> 01:02:28,905
That pain is stabbing through me

1007
01:02:29,664 --> 01:02:35,423
But my work for social welfare can't pause

1008
01:02:35,424 --> 01:02:38,623
so I'm bringing my son into the political arena!

1009
01:02:38,624 --> 01:02:40,624
[cheering and whistling]

1010
01:02:44,545 --> 01:02:49,145
A motherless child, I place him in your care

1011
01:02:51,505 --> 01:02:54,145
And now, my son... no wait!

1012
01:02:54,744 --> 01:02:58,984
The son of your homes, Dhanush,
will now address you all

1013
01:02:59,185 --> 01:03:01,785
[applause and cheering]

1014
01:03:07,024 --> 01:03:10,344
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

1015
01:03:16,024 --> 01:03:18,265
It's so hot out here,
sweat's dripping all over!

1016
01:03:18,624 --> 01:03:20,584
And look at him,
in full suit and boots!

1017
01:03:20,585 --> 01:03:21,944
Does he have any sense at all?

1018
01:03:31,664 --> 01:03:35,304
This fellow can't drop even a simple 'ah' or 'uh'

1019
01:03:47,704 --> 01:03:50,465
Wait, can the guy even speak Kannada?

1020
01:03:51,145 --> 01:03:53,344
He doesn't even know Kannada properly!

1021
01:03:53,465 --> 01:03:55,104
How's he going to understand
people's problems, huh?

1022
01:03:55,105 --> 01:03:55,944
Exactly!

1023
01:04:00,905 --> 01:04:05,983
'Millions of people to watch my acting...
Applause, whistles...'

1024
01:04:05,984 --> 01:04:07,424
'that's what I dreamt of daily!'

1025
01:04:07,984 --> 01:04:10,545
'But now... I can't even get a word out!'

1026
01:04:19,664 --> 01:04:20,905
Speak, damn it!

1027
01:04:21,105 --> 01:04:22,024
Uh...

1028
01:04:25,105 --> 01:04:27,905
I'm not the Dhanush you think

1029
01:04:31,465 --> 01:04:32,785
Uh...?

1030
01:04:40,704 --> 01:04:42,145
None of this is mine

1031
01:04:58,865 --> 01:05:01,785
This fancy suit and tie?
Only for foreign lands!

1032
01:05:02,545 --> 01:05:05,384
The Dhanush I've always
wanted and wished to be

1033
01:05:06,064 --> 01:05:06,984
this is him

1034
01:05:07,344 --> 01:05:08,905
To be one among you

1035
01:05:12,744 --> 01:05:14,064
You all might wonder

1036
01:05:14,505 --> 01:05:17,944
how come a London brought-up guy
like me talks Kannada so fluently?

1037
01:05:18,465 --> 01:05:22,624
The Dhanush before you now,
my language and my word given

1038
01:05:22,984 --> 01:05:23,984
I never forget!

1039
01:05:26,704 --> 01:05:28,904
Not bad this guy!

1040
01:05:28,905 --> 01:05:30,145
He's not what we thought!

1041
01:05:30,384 --> 01:05:33,424
The Dhanush you see now is the real Dhanush

1042
01:05:33,905 --> 01:05:35,703
And now, do I look like one of you?

1043
01:05:35,704 --> 01:05:37,265
Yeah, absolutely!
- Yes! Yes!

1044
01:05:41,145 --> 01:05:45,585
When my father spoke,
he called me a motherless child

1045
01:05:46,265 --> 01:05:49,185
Surrounded by so many loving mothers,
motherless? Never!

1046
01:05:55,984 --> 01:06:01,944
I've stepped into politics, not chasing power,
or to uphold my father's name

1047
01:06:02,865 --> 01:06:04,304
but to serve you, the people!

1048
01:06:05,265 --> 01:06:06,464
He's a clever one!

1049
01:06:06,465 --> 01:06:08,663
He started off clueless,
now he's straight-up killing it!

1050
01:06:08,664 --> 01:06:09,465
Right!

1051
01:06:09,785 --> 01:06:11,505
Yes, I studied abroad

1052
01:06:12,225 --> 01:06:15,984
But all that learning is meant to help our country

1053
01:06:18,545 --> 01:06:22,224
His words show he'll do good
for the people, no doubt

1054
01:06:22,225 --> 01:06:23,904
Yes, indeed!
- You're right!

1055
01:06:23,905 --> 01:06:24,744
Exactly!

1056
01:06:26,744 --> 01:06:28,344
Give me one chance!

1057
01:06:28,984 --> 01:06:32,664
I'll make Karnataka a model
for the entire nation!

1058
01:06:33,265 --> 01:06:34,304
Because

1059
01:06:34,865 --> 01:06:37,505
Loyalty isn't something
I picked up from books

1060
01:06:37,905 --> 01:06:39,905
I've had it since my mother's womb!

1061
01:06:40,624 --> 01:06:42,344
I swear on my mother!

1062
01:06:43,145 --> 01:06:45,904
I'm ready to stand as your soldier,
shielding your heads

1063
01:06:45,905 --> 01:06:47,744
I'm ready to be your slippers,
at your feet always

1064
01:06:48,825 --> 01:06:50,744
Till my last breath

1065
01:06:51,024 --> 01:06:52,225
I'll keep serving you all

1066
01:06:52,984 --> 01:06:54,505
Give me one chance

1067
01:06:54,744 --> 01:06:56,024
Watch Karnataka prosper!

1068
01:06:56,344 --> 01:06:57,664
Give me one chance

1069
01:06:57,944 --> 01:06:59,545
Watch Karnataka prosper! (In unison)

1070
01:06:59,744 --> 01:07:02,464
One chance!
Watch Karnataka prosper!

1071
01:07:02,465 --> 01:07:04,584
All hail youth icon Dhanush Rajashekar!

1072
01:07:04,585 --> 01:07:07,505
[applause and cheering]

1073
01:07:08,704 --> 01:07:10,424
[cheering and whistling]

1074
01:07:12,185 --> 01:07:17,545
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

1075
01:07:38,304 --> 01:07:41,105
All hail the next CM Dhanush Rajashekar!

1076
01:07:42,545 --> 01:07:45,063
Sir, when I said I'm not Dhanush

1077
01:07:45,064 --> 01:07:46,383
you literally had your balls
in your mouth, no sir?

1078
01:07:46,384 --> 01:07:47,104
Huh?

1079
01:07:47,105 --> 01:07:48,225
I saw it, sir!

1080
01:07:48,744 --> 01:07:51,064
W-What's balls in mouth supposed to mean?

1081
01:07:51,225 --> 01:07:52,743
I-I mean...

1082
01:07:52,744 --> 01:07:54,585
Well, forget it
You're educated, no?

1083
01:07:54,704 --> 01:07:55,623
You won't get it

1084
01:07:55,624 --> 01:07:56,384
Take it easy

1085
01:07:57,185 --> 01:07:58,584
Just do as you're told

1086
01:07:58,585 --> 01:08:00,505
If you go overboard again

1087
01:08:00,744 --> 01:08:02,343
that's the end of your hero dreams!

1088
01:08:02,344 --> 01:08:03,343
Please no, sir!

1089
01:08:03,344 --> 01:08:04,424
I won't repeat it

1090
01:08:04,785 --> 01:08:05,585
Sir...

1091
01:08:05,865 --> 01:08:07,024
Sir...
- Hmm?

1092
01:08:07,265 --> 01:08:08,984
Just one quick call to my Rukku, sir!

1093
01:08:09,145 --> 01:08:10,024
Sir...

1094
01:08:10,265 --> 01:08:11,224
Sir...

1095
01:08:11,225 --> 01:08:12,304
Shut up, will you?

1096
01:08:13,944 --> 01:08:15,145
Uncle...

1097
01:08:15,465 --> 01:08:16,984
Please ya, one call!

1098
01:08:19,105 --> 01:08:20,343
Good job, Nambiar

1099
01:08:21,303 --> 01:08:23,303
You've trained Dhanush really well!

1100
01:08:24,504 --> 01:08:27,464
He's my son, after all!

1101
01:08:28,064 --> 01:08:31,225
Politics runs in his blood

1102
01:08:31,944 --> 01:08:34,865
'Even Dhritarashtra was all for the throne,
full of himself and his son'

1103
01:08:36,464 --> 01:08:40,064
'Hundred children,
he still knew who Duryodhana was'

1104
01:08:40,865 --> 01:08:45,105
'But you? Just one son
and you can't even recognise him'

1105
01:09:04,424 --> 01:09:07,144
My heartfelt salutations
to the people of Uttara Karnataka

1106
01:09:07,145 --> 01:09:08,864
All hail Dhanush Anna!

1107
01:09:08,865 --> 01:09:11,063
All hail youth icon Dhanush Anna!

1108
01:09:11,064 --> 01:09:13,584
All hail the next CM Dhanush Anna!

1109
01:09:21,064 --> 01:09:22,785
[crowd hailing in unison]

1110
01:09:32,185 --> 01:09:35,584
All hail Dhanush Anna!

1111
01:09:35,825 --> 01:09:36,503
All hail!

1112
01:09:36,504 --> 01:09:38,543
Last time his father came asking for votes

1113
01:09:38,544 --> 01:09:39,865
This time he's sent his son

1114
01:09:41,384 --> 01:09:43,584
It's either the son or the father

1115
01:09:43,785 --> 01:09:46,265
Authority has turned into
a family affair for them!

1116
01:09:46,704 --> 01:09:49,504
Why, grandpa? CM's son can't run for office?

1117
01:09:49,785 --> 01:09:53,825
From your AC comfort, you'll never know
the burn of our sun-soaked struggle!

1118
01:09:54,024 --> 01:09:55,545
Tell me, grandpa, what should I know?

1119
01:09:55,984 --> 01:09:58,265
How much a kilo for onions? Tell me

1120
01:09:59,465 --> 01:10:01,024
Rs. 25/kg

1121
01:10:01,424 --> 01:10:03,785
100 rupees gets you 5 kilos

1122
01:10:03,905 --> 01:10:05,224
Saw that on TV, huh?

1123
01:10:05,225 --> 01:10:06,264
How much for tomatoes?

1124
01:10:06,265 --> 01:10:07,184
Rs. 30

1125
01:10:07,185 --> 01:10:07,905
Rice?

1126
01:10:10,344 --> 01:10:11,704
Sona Masuri rice, Rs. 60/kg

1127
01:10:11,905 --> 01:10:13,185
Red rice, Rs. 100/kg

1128
01:10:13,384 --> 01:10:14,704
Toor Dal, Rs. 130/kg

1129
01:10:15,105 --> 01:10:17,504
Sugar and wheat Rs. 40 per kilo each

1130
01:10:17,505 --> 01:10:18,464
Rava Rs. 40/kg

1131
01:10:18,465 --> 01:10:19,704
Cooking oil, Rs. 140/kg

1132
01:10:20,024 --> 01:10:21,344
Sesame seeds, Rs. 150/kg

1133
01:10:21,664 --> 01:10:23,943
Rock salt.. Rs. 20/kg

1134
01:10:23,944 --> 01:10:25,624
Regular salt, Rs 28/kg

1135
01:10:25,825 --> 01:10:28,465
One rate in society,
in the black market another

1136
01:10:28,664 --> 01:10:29,904
What more should I know, grandpa?

1137
01:10:29,905 --> 01:10:33,984
Milk, fuel, bills...
You name it, I'll tell you the rate!

1138
01:10:34,704 --> 01:10:36,225
You asked me so many questions

1139
01:10:36,664 --> 01:10:38,185
Tell me, who will you vote for?

1140
01:10:38,384 --> 01:10:39,344
Eh...

1141
01:10:39,704 --> 01:10:42,743
The party that slips more cash into
your hands a day before elections

1142
01:10:42,744 --> 01:10:44,265
that's who you'll vote for, right?

1143
01:10:45,624 --> 01:10:48,185
Selling your vote is just as wrong,
isn't it, grandpa?

1144
01:10:48,424 --> 01:10:49,784
We gotta be proper first

1145
01:10:49,785 --> 01:10:51,465
Then we can question others

1146
01:10:52,944 --> 01:10:54,784
Upright citizens make upright leaders

1147
01:10:54,785 --> 01:10:57,743
and upright leaders make
the whole nation glorious

1148
01:10:57,744 --> 01:10:58,825
See you then, Grandpa

1149
01:11:00,865 --> 01:11:03,384
Brother, pick a name for my baby girl

1150
01:11:04,185 --> 01:11:04,943
Me?

1151
01:11:04,944 --> 01:11:06,024
Yes, you only brother

1152
01:11:10,505 --> 01:11:11,624
Name her 'Rukmini'

1153
01:11:13,984 --> 01:11:16,785
In short 'Rukku', with love

1154
01:11:18,024 --> 01:11:19,104
Rukmini

1155
01:11:19,105 --> 01:11:20,343
Very nice name!

1156
01:11:20,344 --> 01:11:21,303
Thanks, Anna

1157
01:11:21,304 --> 01:11:22,424
[crowd hails in unison]

1158
01:11:22,545 --> 01:11:25,225
All hail the next CM Dhanush Rajashekar!

1159
01:11:26,185 --> 01:11:32,264
Others who come for votes
just saw me as an old vote machine

1160
01:11:32,265 --> 01:11:35,064
But this noble one...
called me 'grandpa' and he meant it

1161
01:11:35,304 --> 01:11:38,464
Stern talk, but straight from heart

1162
01:11:38,465 --> 01:11:40,303
This time, my vote is for him only!

1163
01:11:40,304 --> 01:11:47,265
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

1164
01:11:56,825 --> 01:12:01,063
With this Dhanush-wave,
all our plans are useless

1165
01:12:01,064 --> 01:12:04,904
Especially, with that Nambiar around,
we have no chance

1166
01:12:04,905 --> 01:12:06,145
[Crowd hailing]

1167
01:12:06,304 --> 01:12:07,505
Do you see, sir?

1168
01:12:07,624 --> 01:12:09,865
Look at the crowd,
just 'cause I showed up!

1169
01:12:10,465 --> 01:12:11,824
Hero status achieved, me!

1170
01:12:11,825 --> 01:12:12,743
Oh really?

1171
01:12:12,744 --> 01:12:14,303
How did you
hook up the crowd here?

1172
01:12:14,304 --> 01:12:16,584
Booze plus Biryani

1173
01:12:16,585 --> 01:12:17,623
Rs. 500 per head

1174
01:12:17,624 --> 01:12:19,104
And transport both ways

1175
01:12:19,105 --> 01:12:20,905
Rs. 5 crore in total for the rally

1176
01:12:21,185 --> 01:12:22,104
Alright
- Okay, sir

1177
01:12:22,105 --> 01:12:22,744
Got it now?

1178
01:12:23,304 --> 01:12:28,545
Elections mean hundreds of crores
expense for a party, you know?

1179
01:12:29,064 --> 01:12:32,224
Why waste crores,
when doing real work for people

1180
01:12:32,225 --> 01:12:33,704
brings the votes automatically?

1181
01:12:33,825 --> 01:12:34,944
You smart-mouth!

1182
01:12:36,865 --> 01:12:39,105
Three-fourths of this crowd?
I only pulled them here

1183
01:12:40,424 --> 01:12:41,664
Get this in your head

1184
01:12:42,064 --> 01:12:45,744
When people swarm to you like bees
and hail your name where you stand

1185
01:12:46,545 --> 01:12:48,145
that's when you're a true hero

1186
01:12:48,664 --> 01:12:49,704
Drop that, sir!

1187
01:12:50,024 --> 01:12:52,624
Back in Shivapura,
every question that grandpa threw at me

1188
01:12:52,785 --> 01:12:54,545
I nailed them all on the spot, no?

1189
01:12:54,905 --> 01:12:56,225
As if you taught me that!

1190
01:12:56,545 --> 01:12:58,424
That's my talent, but anyway

1191
01:13:00,024 --> 01:13:01,905
Even Dhanush sir himself

1192
01:13:02,265 --> 01:13:04,624
wouldn't have performed the way
I did to win over the people

1193
01:13:04,744 --> 01:13:05,545
Impressive, no?

1194
01:13:05,704 --> 01:13:07,784
Performance-wise, he's next level!

1195
01:13:07,785 --> 01:13:08,384
Uh...

1196
01:13:16,185 --> 01:13:17,264
Hello...

1197
01:13:17,265 --> 01:13:18,464
How are you, sis?

1198
01:13:18,465 --> 01:13:20,023
Oh, suddenly sis matters now ah?

1199
01:13:20,024 --> 01:13:22,743
Away from traitors like you two,
I'm perfectly fine!

1200
01:13:22,744 --> 01:13:23,584
Hang up now!

1201
01:13:23,585 --> 01:13:25,105
Why so upset, sis?

1202
01:13:25,424 --> 01:13:26,984
Did you and boss fight?

1203
01:13:27,105 --> 01:13:29,104
To fight, he should be worth it first

1204
01:13:29,105 --> 01:13:30,544
Your phone wasn't reachable

1205
01:13:30,545 --> 01:13:32,023
his was switched off

1206
01:13:32,024 --> 01:13:33,785
Sis, my phone was damaged

1207
01:13:33,944 --> 01:13:35,784
Boss got a hero role in a movie

1208
01:13:35,785 --> 01:13:37,224
So he's gone to Bombay

1209
01:13:37,225 --> 01:13:39,664
One who's going to be a hero
won't just switch off and vanish

1210
01:13:40,664 --> 01:13:43,424
He cheated us both
Fraud fellow!

1211
01:13:45,064 --> 01:13:47,624
(Kids shouting and cheering)

1212
01:13:49,105 --> 01:13:51,383
Sir, this school has
150 children studying here

1213
01:13:51,384 --> 01:13:53,505
We provide lunch for all of them daily

1214
01:13:55,744 --> 01:13:56,905
Ew!

1215
01:13:57,304 --> 01:13:58,063
What's wrong?

1216
01:13:58,064 --> 01:13:59,984
Sir, the sambar.. it's spoilt

1217
01:14:00,105 --> 01:14:02,343
Give me 15 minutes,
I'll whip up a first-class sambar!

1218
01:14:02,344 --> 01:14:03,865
Hey, are you crazy?
- Sir...

1219
01:14:04,145 --> 01:14:05,023
It's spoilt

1220
01:14:05,024 --> 01:14:06,464
Poor children... how will they eat it, sir?

1221
01:14:06,465 --> 01:14:08,185
Just hang on 15 minutes, sir,
I'll whip it up quick

1222
01:14:34,664 --> 01:14:35,505
Uncle...

1223
01:14:45,225 --> 01:14:47,704
Such a good soul, no?
- Yeah, exactly!

1224
01:14:49,064 --> 01:14:51,184
Sir.. do you really know to cook?

1225
01:14:51,185 --> 01:14:52,343
You know something?

1226
01:14:52,344 --> 01:14:53,505
My mother was a teacher

1227
01:14:53,825 --> 01:14:57,465
Education and cooking,
she taught me both just as well

1228
01:14:57,704 --> 01:14:59,784
When I was in London,
I used to cook my own meals

1229
01:14:59,785 --> 01:15:01,423
There, you cooked just for yourself

1230
01:15:01,424 --> 01:15:03,184
but how did you pull off cooking
for so many children here?

1231
01:15:03,185 --> 01:15:04,145
Very simple!

1232
01:15:04,265 --> 01:15:05,744
Ratio's one to thirty, that's all!

1233
01:15:06,105 --> 01:15:08,704
Looks like just an election stunt to me

1234
01:15:12,304 --> 01:15:18,185
'Dhanush Rajashekar himself cooks and serves,
turning food giver for school kids'

1235
01:15:48,304 --> 01:15:50,785
'Dhanush Rajashekar's wave sweeps across the state'

1236
01:15:55,585 --> 01:15:58,424
'Opposition left stunned as Dhanush storm rages'

1237
01:15:59,344 --> 01:16:02,424
'All signs indicate Dhanush will be the next CM'

1238
01:16:04,064 --> 01:16:05,384
Shall we play?

1239
01:16:13,664 --> 01:16:16,384
[Crowd erupts in applause and cheering]

1240
01:16:28,505 --> 01:16:30,265
He's my son, after all!

1241
01:18:14,865 --> 01:18:16,304
Mr. Nambiar!
- Sir!

1242
01:18:17,265 --> 01:18:21,585
Is it my luck failing me, or my faith?

1243
01:18:21,865 --> 01:18:22,784
Sir, the thing is...

1244
01:18:22,785 --> 01:18:23,664
Bloody hell!

1245
01:18:25,265 --> 01:18:27,424
You said the case won't hold,
and I'd be out just like that

1246
01:18:27,545 --> 01:18:28,545
But I got convicted anyway!

1247
01:18:29,265 --> 01:18:31,343
My son was supposed to take over as CM

1248
01:18:31,344 --> 01:18:33,545
but you're having some nobody
to campaign in his place!

1249
01:18:34,465 --> 01:18:38,184
I feel like I'm surrounded by traitors!

1250
01:18:38,185 --> 01:18:38,865
Damn it!

1251
01:18:39,545 --> 01:18:41,785
Sir, remember why we sent
Dhanush away from here?

1252
01:18:46,905 --> 01:18:50,104
Don't even think about doing
this disgraceful act again!

1253
01:18:50,105 --> 01:18:50,905
Sir!

1254
01:18:52,225 --> 01:18:54,063
What happened, sir?
What's wrong?

1255
01:18:54,064 --> 01:18:54,905
What's wrong, you ask?

1256
01:18:55,744 --> 01:18:57,145
Enough of that look!

1257
01:18:57,304 --> 01:18:58,905
Spit it out,
let him hear that too!

1258
01:18:59,545 --> 01:19:04,424
Sir... Dhanush raped his classmate

1259
01:19:08,225 --> 01:19:09,505
Did you file an FIR?

1260
01:19:09,984 --> 01:19:10,984
Not yet, sir

1261
01:19:11,105 --> 01:19:12,185
Don't

1262
01:19:12,505 --> 01:19:14,465
I'll get stars added to your shoulders

1263
01:19:16,145 --> 01:19:17,624
O-Okay, sir

1264
01:19:17,944 --> 01:19:21,545
If this rogue stays here,
he'll wreck my whole political career

1265
01:19:22,384 --> 01:19:26,185
Listen, I don't care where you
send him or what you do with him

1266
01:19:26,585 --> 01:19:29,905
Before I wrap the party meeting
and return, he must be gone

1267
01:19:30,785 --> 01:19:31,864
Sir, he's your only child

1268
01:19:31,865 --> 01:19:33,584
Put some sense into him,
he might mend

1269
01:19:33,585 --> 01:19:34,983
Sit down and put sense into him?

1270
01:19:34,984 --> 01:19:37,624
I have money to spare for him

1271
01:19:39,265 --> 01:19:40,105
but not TIME

1272
01:19:53,664 --> 01:19:56,664
'Metallic flute with colours bright'

1273
01:19:56,865 --> 01:19:59,984
'Kasturi bought it, spent her might'

1274
01:20:04,344 --> 01:20:06,505
You raped a girl, and
the audacity to mouth rhymes?

1275
01:20:07,505 --> 01:20:09,585
The acts you've committed at your age!

1276
01:20:10,145 --> 01:20:11,785
You call that 'acts', Uncs?

1277
01:20:14,664 --> 01:20:17,185
I told her I sincerely love her

1278
01:20:17,344 --> 01:20:21,185
But she created a drama,
claiming she already has a boyfriend

1279
01:20:21,424 --> 01:20:23,384
That's when your CM's line hit me

1280
01:20:24,505 --> 01:20:27,265
If you desire something, ASK for it
If denied, take it by FORCE

1281
01:20:29,905 --> 01:20:32,344
I asked for her heart, Uncs
She denied me

1282
01:20:32,825 --> 01:20:34,744
so I took something else instead!

1283
01:20:35,465 --> 01:20:36,624
Sir...

1284
01:20:36,984 --> 01:20:38,943
At his speed, it feels like

1285
01:20:38,944 --> 01:20:42,465
all the stars in the sky
will be on my uniform!

1286
01:20:42,944 --> 01:20:44,784
I swear on my mother

1287
01:20:44,785 --> 01:20:46,585
I don't have that capacity, sir

1288
01:20:47,304 --> 01:20:48,504
Please, sir

1289
01:20:48,505 --> 01:20:49,624
Send him away somewhere

1290
01:20:54,344 --> 01:20:57,225
'Come to India, Thimma'

1291
01:20:57,944 --> 01:21:00,304
'I don't want to, Maama'

1292
01:21:00,984 --> 01:21:03,465
'Then why come now, Thimma?'

1293
01:21:03,585 --> 01:21:05,624
'To play the game and winnah!'

1294
01:21:07,545 --> 01:21:09,785
Your son who walked by singing

1295
01:21:10,105 --> 01:21:12,465
you think he's the great SP Balasubramanian?

1296
01:21:13,064 --> 01:21:16,105
Do you know what his
life and lifestyle was like in London?

1297
01:21:19,704 --> 01:21:22,785
When he was here before, he was like a
mild fever you could catch on a thermometer

1298
01:21:23,064 --> 01:21:25,744
Now he's a full-blown cancer,
even chemotherapy can't tame

1299
01:21:32,664 --> 01:21:34,185
You flew all the way here

1300
01:21:34,865 --> 01:21:36,865
don't make it a coffin-ride back!

1301
01:21:40,105 --> 01:21:41,424
You goof!

1302
01:21:42,185 --> 01:21:44,825
You should've just told me straight
if he wouldn't come

1303
01:21:45,785 --> 01:21:49,585
Instead why make me believe
that this clown is my son?

1304
01:21:49,744 --> 01:21:52,144
Sir, I was about to tell you, by then

1305
01:21:52,145 --> 01:21:55,704
Dhanush's photo and news of
his return to India had gone viral

1306
01:21:56,744 --> 01:21:59,943
And you were breathing down my neck,
demanding your son be brought here

1307
01:21:59,944 --> 01:22:01,904
Unable to answer the media

1308
01:22:01,905 --> 01:22:04,785
I was rattled, not knowing
how to navigate the situation

1309
01:22:05,265 --> 01:22:07,704
Then by chance,
I saw Krishna, Dhanush's look-alike

1310
01:22:11,344 --> 01:22:14,704
Those hungry for chances
are easy to bend to your will

1311
01:22:15,225 --> 01:22:16,545
And are low-risk too

1312
01:22:17,465 --> 01:22:20,785
That's why I've set Krishna to act as Dhanush

1313
01:22:21,064 --> 01:22:22,464
Do you know something, sir?

1314
01:22:22,465 --> 01:22:27,744
All the top leaders around the world always
keep a look-alike body double for safety

1315
01:22:27,944 --> 01:22:29,703
Just that, here the reason is different

1316
01:22:29,704 --> 01:22:32,344
Eh! I don't care about all that!
Now that my son is here

1317
01:22:32,905 --> 01:22:34,785
No need for that kitchen hand anymore!

1318
01:22:35,064 --> 01:22:36,784
With Dhanush's kind of attitude

1319
01:22:36,785 --> 01:22:38,943
if you put him in front of the people

1320
01:22:38,944 --> 01:22:41,225
forget winning,
we'd lose deposit too, sir!

1321
01:22:42,064 --> 01:22:44,624
Rallies and meetings may be your strategy

1322
01:22:45,024 --> 01:22:48,785
but the love of the people is
for the persona I've created

1323
01:22:49,265 --> 01:22:50,865
My calculation is on point

1324
01:22:54,984 --> 01:22:55,825
Ummah!

1325
01:22:55,944 --> 01:22:57,105
Why did you come now?

1326
01:22:57,225 --> 01:22:58,465
You ask why?

1327
01:22:58,944 --> 01:23:03,545
My surprise entry flipped your
plans upside down, huh, Uncs?

1328
01:23:03,984 --> 01:23:07,064
Watching you and your CM shudder

1329
01:23:07,865 --> 01:23:09,344
gives me a nice kick!

1330
01:23:09,585 --> 01:23:10,864
Why didn't you come when I asked?

1331
01:23:10,865 --> 01:23:16,105
What's mine can wait,
it's what others hold that I grab for

1332
01:23:16,505 --> 01:23:19,865
Seeing some fellow
score big in my place

1333
01:23:20,624 --> 01:23:22,224
got me slightly pissed

1334
01:23:22,225 --> 01:23:23,785
So I flew in and landed!

1335
01:23:24,304 --> 01:23:25,384
Mr. Nambiar!

1336
01:23:27,664 --> 01:23:30,505
Get rid of all his showy looks and
bring him to the party office tomorrow

1337
01:23:32,064 --> 01:23:36,144
Sir, his looks can be changed,
but not his chaos!

1338
01:23:36,145 --> 01:23:37,864
I know what has to be done from now on

1339
01:23:37,865 --> 01:23:38,784
Just bring him

1340
01:23:38,785 --> 01:23:39,585
But, sir...

1341
01:23:39,825 --> 01:23:41,105
I said bring him

1342
01:23:45,785 --> 01:23:48,105
[crowd hailing in unison]

1343
01:23:52,545 --> 01:23:54,303
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

1344
01:23:54,304 --> 01:23:56,225
All hail Karunada People's Party!

1345
01:23:57,825 --> 01:23:58,984
'Karunada People's Party'

1346
01:24:13,744 --> 01:24:17,304
That costume-hero of yours
has fooled people really well

1347
01:24:18,064 --> 01:24:18,864
Ummah!

1348
01:24:18,865 --> 01:24:19,785
Just come

1349
01:24:21,105 --> 01:24:22,984
Bro! Bro!

1350
01:24:23,944 --> 01:24:24,825
Hi, bro!

1351
01:24:25,664 --> 01:24:27,023
Who the hell are you?

1352
01:24:27,024 --> 01:24:27,865
Eh?

1353
01:24:28,344 --> 01:24:30,024
Uh, he's just joking!

1354
01:24:32,585 --> 01:24:36,225
Bro... Madras eye?

1355
01:24:37,384 --> 01:24:38,743
Chenn(eye)!

1356
01:24:38,744 --> 01:24:39,424
Chen-

1357
01:24:39,905 --> 01:24:41,023
Dhanush... Hmm

1358
01:24:41,024 --> 01:24:42,545
Rajashekar will address the crowd...

1359
01:24:42,704 --> 01:24:43,865
Greetings to one and all

1360
01:24:44,865 --> 01:24:47,544
Politics is not a seat of power to enjoy

1361
01:24:47,545 --> 01:24:49,264
It must be understood as a duty of service

1362
01:24:49,265 --> 01:24:52,624
That's why, first I sent Dhanush
to mingle with the masses

1363
01:24:53,384 --> 01:24:55,663
To understand their needs and lacks

1364
01:24:55,664 --> 01:24:58,704
To engage with the party workers
and give his best effort

1365
01:24:58,984 --> 01:25:01,744
Only then can he become a true public servant

1366
01:25:02,145 --> 01:25:07,024
Only after I was sure he had earned all this,
I've brought Dhanush into the party office

1367
01:25:30,825 --> 01:25:32,984
Our party stands on many strong principles

1368
01:25:34,905 --> 01:25:35,624
Hi!

1369
01:25:39,265 --> 01:25:40,785
Elections are near

1370
01:25:41,105 --> 01:25:42,984
we must work together in unity

1371
01:25:44,744 --> 01:25:45,265
Hey...

1372
01:25:57,704 --> 01:26:00,545
Because for us,
service matters more than authority

1373
01:26:01,344 --> 01:26:03,304
and the party is bigger than any one individual

1374
01:26:03,585 --> 01:26:06,105
With this, I conclude my words

1375
01:26:06,384 --> 01:26:07,585
Thank you

1376
01:26:12,984 --> 01:26:13,905
Huh?

1377
01:26:24,024 --> 01:26:28,545
Up next, Ms. Rita, president of the women's
wing of our party, will speak a few words

1378
01:26:33,465 --> 01:26:36,744
S-Sir, you got mixed up - wrong place

1379
01:26:37,145 --> 01:26:38,545
Wrong place

1380
01:26:38,825 --> 01:26:39,865
but right time

1381
01:26:43,225 --> 01:26:45,265
Sir, why bolt the door?

1382
01:26:48,505 --> 01:26:50,825
If you don't mind the door being open

1383
01:26:51,304 --> 01:26:52,664
I don't mind either

1384
01:26:53,265 --> 01:26:55,663
You're all decent in public

1385
01:26:55,664 --> 01:26:56,704
why this behaviour here?

1386
01:26:58,265 --> 01:27:00,265
He is one

1387
01:27:00,704 --> 01:27:02,064
and I'm entirely another!

1388
01:27:02,384 --> 01:27:04,505
It's all politics!
- Sir...

1389
01:27:05,064 --> 01:27:06,185
Sir, please leave me

1390
01:27:11,185 --> 01:27:11,825
Sir!

1391
01:27:18,225 --> 01:27:19,303
Ma'am!

1392
01:27:19,304 --> 01:27:19,864
Sir!

1393
01:27:19,865 --> 01:27:20,505
Ma'am!

1394
01:27:20,865 --> 01:27:21,744
Ms. Sushila!

1395
01:27:22,265 --> 01:27:23,984
[Loud knocking on door]

1396
01:27:27,384 --> 01:27:28,465
U-Uh.. Ma'am!

1397
01:27:29,225 --> 01:27:31,304
Everything alright?
What happened...

1398
01:27:39,145 --> 01:27:40,465
Uh...

1399
01:27:40,905 --> 01:27:42,704
Ma'am, all okay?

1400
01:27:42,905 --> 01:27:44,983
Sir, I'm asking you the same

1401
01:27:44,984 --> 01:27:45,865
what actually happened?

1402
01:27:46,304 --> 01:27:48,225
Dhanush... he came after you, no?

1403
01:27:48,905 --> 01:27:51,264
Aiyo, no sir!
He never did!

1404
01:27:51,265 --> 01:27:52,224
You came...

1405
01:27:52,225 --> 01:27:53,185
Slipped and fell.

1406
01:27:53,505 --> 01:27:54,505
But tell me...

1407
01:27:54,825 --> 01:27:56,704
what were you doing
near the ladies' toilet?

1408
01:27:57,265 --> 01:28:00,424
No, I saw it myself!
Dhanush came after you!

1409
01:28:00,944 --> 01:28:03,024
I heard you scream
You're lying now!

1410
01:28:05,545 --> 01:28:07,984
What drink did you take last night, huh?

1411
01:28:21,545 --> 01:28:22,865
How much cash do you want?

1412
01:28:23,865 --> 01:28:27,664
Cash... plus one election ticket,
and a post after the victory

1413
01:28:31,384 --> 01:28:32,865
Cash, any sum is okay

1414
01:28:33,064 --> 01:28:34,664
But ticket and post?
That's a tough ask

1415
01:28:35,865 --> 01:28:39,265
I didn't come here to play Crorepati
to pick from your options

1416
01:28:39,704 --> 01:28:40,905
nor am I in the hot seat

1417
01:28:42,424 --> 01:28:44,424
You're the ones in the hot seat now!

1418
01:28:45,185 --> 01:28:48,424
Lock in the option I gave, no other choice!

1419
01:28:56,825 --> 01:28:58,105
Everything you asked for, granted

1420
01:28:58,384 --> 01:29:00,905
Provided the party office incident
and you coming here

1421
01:29:01,064 --> 01:29:02,344
none of it must come out

1422
01:29:02,865 --> 01:29:05,225
Hmm, I won't breathe a word outside

1423
01:29:06,344 --> 01:29:07,544
Thank you so much, sir

1424
01:29:07,545 --> 01:29:08,505
See you

1425
01:29:12,265 --> 01:29:13,825
HI, DARLING!

1426
01:29:15,064 --> 01:29:16,465
Mood off, huh?

1427
01:29:16,744 --> 01:29:18,544
Say yes, and I'll get your mood back on

1428
01:29:18,545 --> 01:29:19,623
Not interested

1429
01:29:19,624 --> 01:29:21,304
Your business here is done, right? Just leave

1430
01:29:21,905 --> 01:29:23,064
Call me!

1431
01:29:23,304 --> 01:29:24,504
Hmmm

1432
01:29:24,505 --> 01:29:26,145
Suddenly Mr. Good-guy, huh?

1433
01:29:26,465 --> 01:29:28,505
Where'd this "good-guy" act
go at the party office earlier?

1434
01:29:30,105 --> 01:29:32,304
Out of Indians touch, Uncs!

1435
01:29:34,384 --> 01:29:35,224
Up on your feet!

1436
01:29:35,225 --> 01:29:35,904
Sir! Sir!

1437
01:29:35,905 --> 01:29:36,545
Damn you!

1438
01:29:37,265 --> 01:29:38,905
For the damn mess you made

1439
01:29:39,145 --> 01:29:41,184
that lady, who doesn't
deserve to stand before me

1440
01:29:41,185 --> 01:29:42,944
dares to sit cross-legged in front of me!

1441
01:29:43,465 --> 01:29:45,905
Pull that filthy act again
and I won't spare you

1442
01:29:46,265 --> 01:29:47,505
being my son won't save you!

1443
01:29:55,064 --> 01:29:57,184
Sir, he's walking away, quietly

1444
01:29:57,185 --> 01:29:58,024
Stop it!

1445
01:29:58,984 --> 01:30:00,465
Should've made him taste fear from the start

1446
01:30:00,664 --> 01:30:02,904
Sir, never mind his fear,
fear's on me here

1447
01:30:02,905 --> 01:30:04,505
Can't guess the havoc he'll unleash

1448
01:30:05,344 --> 01:30:07,185
- Sikandar... Turn on the GPS
- Sir

1449
01:30:09,785 --> 01:30:11,584
Greetings, sir
One photo, sir...

1450
01:30:11,585 --> 01:30:12,185
Hmm

1451
01:30:12,384 --> 01:30:13,465
One selfie for me, sir

1452
01:30:13,825 --> 01:30:14,905
Uh!
- Selfie, sir!

1453
01:30:15,944 --> 01:30:17,304
Uncle...

1454
01:30:17,865 --> 01:30:19,344
Oh, Dhanush...

1455
01:30:19,704 --> 01:30:21,624
Sorry 'sir', please come

1456
01:30:22,304 --> 01:30:24,384
Uncle!

1457
01:30:24,785 --> 01:30:27,384
For a childish error in my childhood days

1458
01:30:27,865 --> 01:30:30,785
I didn't thank you even once for saving me!

1459
01:30:30,905 --> 01:30:31,623
Leave it...

1460
01:30:31,624 --> 01:30:32,504
Thanks a lot, Uncle

1461
01:30:32,505 --> 01:30:33,424
Thanks a lot

1462
01:30:33,744 --> 01:30:34,584
Okay, okay...

1463
01:30:34,585 --> 01:30:35,505
Ow!

1464
01:30:36,384 --> 01:30:38,865
Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star...

1465
01:30:39,145 --> 01:30:40,825
I am your promotion star!

1466
01:30:41,704 --> 01:30:44,504
Correct...
- Ohhh, Uncle! Chris Gayle!

1467
01:30:44,505 --> 01:30:46,105
Heyyy man!
- Eyy, he's not Chris Gayle...

1468
01:30:46,944 --> 01:30:48,104
What are you doing, bro?

1469
01:30:48,105 --> 01:30:49,265
Huh?
- Sir, sir...

1470
01:30:49,785 --> 01:30:51,464
He's not that cricket player!

1471
01:30:51,465 --> 01:30:53,104
Local guy from Kammagondanahalli

1472
01:30:53,105 --> 01:30:54,303
A drug peddler

1473
01:30:54,304 --> 01:30:55,825
He was caught red-handed

1474
01:30:55,984 --> 01:30:57,504
And he can speak Kannada too!

1475
01:30:57,505 --> 01:30:58,104
Huh?

1476
01:30:58,105 --> 01:30:59,824
Yes, sir, I can speak Kannada

1477
01:30:59,825 --> 01:31:00,825
Aww!

1478
01:31:01,185 --> 01:31:04,465
A brother from... another mother

1479
01:31:06,704 --> 01:31:08,343
But not the same father

1480
01:31:08,344 --> 01:31:09,265
Yayyy!

1481
01:31:09,424 --> 01:31:10,584
Uh, stuff?

1482
01:31:10,585 --> 01:31:11,384
Yeah, sir, yeah!

1483
01:31:11,585 --> 01:31:12,905
First-grade stuff!

1484
01:31:15,465 --> 01:31:16,384
Sir, no, sir!

1485
01:31:17,225 --> 01:31:17,904
Mmm!

1486
01:31:17,905 --> 01:31:18,944
Try, sir, try!

1487
01:31:19,064 --> 01:31:20,024
Oh no!

1488
01:31:23,624 --> 01:31:24,865
Third-graded stuff!

1489
01:31:25,064 --> 01:31:26,224
You b*****d!
- Sir, no!

1490
01:31:26,225 --> 01:31:28,104
You are cheating all our
Indian brothers and sisters

1491
01:31:28,105 --> 01:31:30,144
I kill you, man!
- Sir, no, please!

1492
01:31:30,145 --> 01:31:31,824
Sir, please don't beat him up

1493
01:31:31,825 --> 01:31:32,944
Sir, please tell him to stop

1494
01:31:33,465 --> 01:31:34,264
Ah!

1495
01:31:34,265 --> 01:31:35,384
Beat him? No

1496
01:31:35,505 --> 01:31:36,983
He should be shot down, no mercy!

1497
01:31:36,984 --> 01:31:37,983
Oh no!

1498
01:31:37,984 --> 01:31:38,784
I WILL shoot you!

1499
01:31:38,785 --> 01:31:39,983
Sir, please, don't! I'll lose my job!

1500
01:31:39,984 --> 01:31:42,023
He was only gonna beat me,
you're making him shoot!

1501
01:31:42,024 --> 01:31:43,224
Eyy, shut up!

1502
01:31:43,225 --> 01:31:43,944
Dhanush, stop!

1503
01:31:44,145 --> 01:31:45,063
What the hell are you doing?

1504
01:31:45,064 --> 01:31:46,465
Drop the gun now!
Give me that!

1505
01:31:46,624 --> 01:31:47,623
You! Get lost!

1506
01:31:47,624 --> 01:31:48,384
Thank God!

1507
01:31:51,545 --> 01:31:52,743
Sir...

1508
01:31:52,744 --> 01:31:53,424
Thank you, sir

1509
01:31:55,304 --> 01:31:56,545
What's with him, sir?

1510
01:31:56,664 --> 01:31:58,545
Onstage he's one man,
offstage he's someone else

1511
01:32:01,145 --> 01:32:03,105
It's all politics!

1512
01:32:04,024 --> 01:32:08,185
He's one... I'm entirely another

1513
01:32:08,424 --> 01:32:09,545
What's he saying, sir?

1514
01:32:09,825 --> 01:32:11,424
He claims he's different from that one

1515
01:32:11,545 --> 01:32:12,943
Are you like this all the time?

1516
01:32:12,944 --> 01:32:13,664
What do you mean?

1517
01:32:13,944 --> 01:32:15,544
Don't you change after drinks at night?

1518
01:32:15,545 --> 01:32:18,264
Sir, I drink at night, but he's
already drunk in the morning!

1519
01:32:18,265 --> 01:32:19,464
He lived in Europe

1520
01:32:19,465 --> 01:32:20,944
Daytime here, nighttime there

1521
01:32:21,185 --> 01:32:22,584
So he's tuned to that time

1522
01:32:22,585 --> 01:32:23,303
Correct, sir

1523
01:32:23,304 --> 01:32:24,423
Wait outside
- Okay, sir

1524
01:32:24,424 --> 01:32:25,145
Go

1525
01:32:25,465 --> 01:32:26,664
What the hell are you doing?

1526
01:32:28,304 --> 01:32:29,624
Damn it!

1527
01:32:30,465 --> 01:32:32,865
This is your idea of a country?
And you humans?

1528
01:32:33,505 --> 01:32:35,983
Can't take down one fool here!

1529
01:32:35,984 --> 01:32:38,384
Can't enjoy a woman in peace either!

1530
01:32:38,664 --> 01:32:42,825
Restrictions on restrictions
for every damn thing

1531
01:32:43,064 --> 01:32:45,384
How do you all even survive here, Uncs?

1532
01:32:45,704 --> 01:32:46,704
Power!

1533
01:32:48,905 --> 01:32:51,624
If you want to live on your terms,
and do what you wish

1534
01:32:51,785 --> 01:32:53,465
wait till you're the CM

1535
01:32:54,145 --> 01:32:56,423
After that, no restrictions,
no one to question you

1536
01:32:56,424 --> 01:32:58,545
You can go anywhere, do anything

1537
01:32:58,704 --> 01:33:01,064
Convoys, security, all at your back

1538
01:33:01,664 --> 01:33:03,024
You'll live a king's life

1539
01:33:03,424 --> 01:33:05,024
M-Mehehehe!

1540
01:33:05,664 --> 01:33:08,624
You think you I'm a fool, Uncs?

1541
01:33:09,785 --> 01:33:14,344
The one wrapped in security ain't a king,
one who owns his freedom is!

1542
01:33:15,825 --> 01:33:18,624
I'd rather die a king's death

1543
01:33:20,064 --> 01:33:21,744
than live a slave's life!

1544
01:33:22,744 --> 01:33:24,704
Get my private jet ready

1545
01:33:25,064 --> 01:33:26,864
I want to go back, Uncs

1546
01:33:26,865 --> 01:33:28,185
You can't just leave like that!

1547
01:33:28,344 --> 01:33:30,144
We've picked you as the next CM!

1548
01:33:30,145 --> 01:33:32,105
That's your problem, Uncs!

1549
01:33:32,825 --> 01:33:39,064
Ah, use that costume-hero of yours...
Make him CM or a bottom-rung slave

1550
01:33:41,545 --> 01:33:42,545
Dhanush!

1551
01:33:43,905 --> 01:33:45,424
THE DEVIL

1552
01:34:07,944 --> 01:34:09,464
All arrangements need to be proper...

1553
01:34:09,465 --> 01:34:10,943
Where are you headed so late?

1554
01:34:10,944 --> 01:34:13,064
Have some work, I'll be back, Appa

1555
01:34:13,465 --> 01:34:16,225
My daughter, are you really happy?

1556
01:34:20,465 --> 01:34:21,504
Look there, Appa

1557
01:34:21,505 --> 01:34:24,504
At last, the groom is exactly
what I wished for my daughter

1558
01:34:24,505 --> 01:34:26,225
Mother's happy, isn't she?

1559
01:34:26,905 --> 01:34:28,145
That's enough
- My child...

1560
01:34:28,265 --> 01:34:30,024
It's not just about that

1561
01:34:30,545 --> 01:34:32,184
When hope turns to lies

1562
01:34:32,185 --> 01:34:35,344
decisions and actions must change,
right, Appa?

1563
01:34:44,465 --> 01:34:46,983
Ma'am, came solo today?
Where's your 6-foot giant buddy?

1564
01:34:46,984 --> 01:34:48,663
Who the hell knows where he's gone!

1565
01:34:48,664 --> 01:34:49,703
Shut up and hand over the money!

1566
01:34:49,704 --> 01:34:51,824
You men are all the same, just frauds!

1567
01:34:51,825 --> 01:34:54,024
Come on, why are you losing your cool?

1568
01:34:54,905 --> 01:34:55,905
Huh?

1569
01:34:56,064 --> 01:34:56,905
Hey ma'am!

1570
01:34:57,064 --> 01:34:58,464
That's my glass, ma'am!
- That's his peg!

1571
01:34:58,465 --> 01:34:59,743
Deduct from your next payment!

1572
01:34:59,744 --> 01:35:00,384
Damn you!

1573
01:35:00,545 --> 01:35:02,504
Instead of taking up a job
my education was meant for

1574
01:35:02,505 --> 01:35:04,623
I chose my father's daily finance business

1575
01:35:04,624 --> 01:35:05,664
and went and fell for him

1576
01:35:05,905 --> 01:35:07,664
and now I'm paying for it, damn mess!

1577
01:35:18,064 --> 01:35:19,664
Stop the car!

1578
01:35:27,905 --> 01:35:31,304
Sir, he stopped the car
right near Vidhana Soudha

1579
01:35:34,865 --> 01:35:36,064
Damn this phone!

1580
01:35:39,384 --> 01:35:40,505
This fellow!

1581
01:35:41,624 --> 01:35:42,744
Hello...

1582
01:35:43,024 --> 01:35:44,905
After all these days,
you picked up the call, sis!

1583
01:35:45,064 --> 01:35:46,785
So Boss must've told you everything

1584
01:35:46,984 --> 01:35:49,185
First of all, I don't need your boss's matters

1585
01:35:49,505 --> 01:35:50,785
Listen properly

1586
01:35:51,024 --> 01:35:52,224
I'm already engaged

1587
01:35:52,225 --> 01:35:52,784
Sis...

1588
01:35:52,785 --> 01:35:54,304
And the wedding is happening soon

1589
01:35:54,664 --> 01:35:56,983
I'll WhatsApp the invite

1590
01:35:56,984 --> 01:35:59,584
You and your boss can come
and stuff yourselves

1591
01:35:59,585 --> 01:36:01,544
Sis, Boss will definitely come back

1592
01:36:01,545 --> 01:36:02,423
Please, sis!
- Hang up now

1593
01:36:02,424 --> 01:36:03,664
Please, sis! Don't be hasty

1594
01:36:04,145 --> 01:36:04,864
Damn it!

1595
01:36:04,865 --> 01:36:08,265
Is authority really that addictive?

1596
01:36:08,744 --> 01:36:10,185
Maybe that's why

1597
01:36:10,505 --> 01:36:17,304
Even at 70, Rajashekar is still pulling
every string to hold on to power

1598
01:36:28,785 --> 01:36:32,185
'Boss got a hero chance,
so he's gone to Bombay'

1599
01:36:36,624 --> 01:36:37,704
Krishna...

1600
01:36:39,944 --> 01:36:41,225
Not for me, no!

1601
01:36:41,704 --> 01:36:43,424
If I stay here any longer

1602
01:36:43,744 --> 01:36:45,744
Even I might fall for this

1603
01:36:45,944 --> 01:36:46,785
No!

1604
01:36:47,384 --> 01:36:48,585
Krishna...

1605
01:36:55,064 --> 01:36:57,904
Your life is nothing but acting on the streets!

1606
01:36:57,905 --> 01:36:58,905
Look at me!

1607
01:37:00,785 --> 01:37:03,545
I walked out of my house for you...
shame on you!

1608
01:37:15,344 --> 01:37:17,905
From now on, your life is yours,
mine is mine

1609
01:37:18,105 --> 01:37:20,423
I'll never face you again, ever!

1610
01:37:20,424 --> 01:37:22,265
Never again!

1611
01:37:22,865 --> 01:37:25,064
You're all lies and full of masks

1612
01:37:42,145 --> 01:37:43,384
I love you, Krishna!

1613
01:37:43,505 --> 01:37:45,064
I want you!

1614
01:37:45,424 --> 01:37:48,585
I can't live without you, I really can't!

1615
01:38:24,545 --> 01:38:25,865
Sir, uh...

1616
01:38:26,225 --> 01:38:27,984
S-Sir, I mistook you for my Krishna...

1617
01:38:28,344 --> 01:38:29,384
Sir, sorry...

1618
01:38:29,984 --> 01:38:31,505
Y-You are not my Krishna...

1619
01:38:58,545 --> 01:39:00,304
Hey, what the hell is this?

1620
01:39:00,865 --> 01:39:02,585
Bring your costume-hero over

1621
01:39:03,545 --> 01:39:05,185
I'll show you a proper cinema!

1622
01:39:13,984 --> 01:39:15,624
Rukku!

1623
01:39:16,024 --> 01:39:16,704
Hey Rukku!

1624
01:39:17,505 --> 01:39:18,225
Rukku!

1625
01:39:18,465 --> 01:39:19,185
Rukku!

1626
01:39:19,344 --> 01:39:20,105
Rukku...

1627
01:39:21,424 --> 01:39:22,264
Rukku!

1628
01:39:22,265 --> 01:39:23,104
Rukku...

1629
01:39:23,105 --> 01:39:25,383
H-Hey, it's me Krishna!

1630
01:39:25,384 --> 01:39:26,144
How did you get here?

1631
01:39:26,145 --> 01:39:27,864
Rukku, it's me Krishna!
- No!

1632
01:39:27,865 --> 01:39:29,184
Sir... please!

1633
01:39:29,185 --> 01:39:30,623
You're not my Krishna!
- Rukku!

1634
01:39:30,624 --> 01:39:31,303
Rukku...

1635
01:39:31,304 --> 01:39:32,943
No! S-Sorry, sir!
- Rukku...

1636
01:39:32,944 --> 01:39:35,265
I mistook you for Krishna and... hit you, sir!

1637
01:39:35,505 --> 01:39:36,144
Sir, really sorry...

1638
01:39:36,145 --> 01:39:36,944
Rukku

1639
01:39:37,265 --> 01:39:40,304
Krishna's mess, famous dish...

1640
01:39:41,145 --> 01:39:43,825
Khara Uppsaaru, Mudde-bassaru!

1641
01:39:46,545 --> 01:39:47,184
Ha!

1642
01:39:47,185 --> 01:39:48,545
Krishna?
- Ha!

1643
01:39:51,545 --> 01:39:52,784
Krishna...

1644
01:39:52,785 --> 01:39:56,344
I thought it was you... I didn't realize

1645
01:40:01,424 --> 01:40:03,185
I didn't realize

1646
01:40:07,585 --> 01:40:08,825
Krishna...

1647
01:40:14,145 --> 01:40:14,905
Huh?!

1648
01:40:18,545 --> 01:40:19,585
Sir, uh...

1649
01:40:19,984 --> 01:40:20,905
How did you...

1650
01:40:26,585 --> 01:40:27,585
Krishna!

1651
01:40:27,785 --> 01:40:29,024
Ohhh!

1652
01:40:30,304 --> 01:40:31,424
Oh no!

1653
01:40:31,744 --> 01:40:32,545
Krishna!

1654
01:40:37,265 --> 01:40:39,504
Sir, please don't beat him!

1655
01:40:39,505 --> 01:40:41,423
Please don't hurt Krishna, sir!

1656
01:40:41,424 --> 01:40:45,265
All that care and concern
you're showing him

1657
01:40:46,785 --> 01:40:49,384
it's disturbing me lots!

1658
01:40:49,785 --> 01:40:52,225
Stop saying his name

1659
01:40:52,545 --> 01:40:54,185
and I'll spare his life!

1660
01:40:55,424 --> 01:40:57,944
Ha! That's better!

1661
01:40:59,944 --> 01:41:00,905
Dhanush!

1662
01:41:01,905 --> 01:41:02,704
Stop!

1663
01:41:03,984 --> 01:41:04,984
Let go of him!

1664
01:41:09,865 --> 01:41:11,825
DEVIL

1665
01:41:13,265 --> 01:41:15,624
THE DEVIL

1666
01:41:17,905 --> 01:41:18,664
Oh no!

1667
01:41:24,384 --> 01:41:25,905
Hey Dhanush! Stop it!

1668
01:41:27,545 --> 01:41:29,785
If something happens to him,
the campaign's screwed!

1669
01:41:31,545 --> 01:41:33,304
Why are you beating me like this, sir?

1670
01:41:34,505 --> 01:41:35,584
Hey Dhanush!
- Oh no!

1671
01:41:35,585 --> 01:41:36,664
Krishna!

1672
01:41:45,984 --> 01:41:48,023
Uncs, I'm in love

1673
01:41:48,024 --> 01:41:49,063
You? In love?

1674
01:41:49,064 --> 01:41:50,384
And I'm supposed to believe that?

1675
01:41:50,664 --> 01:41:53,585
My love for her deserves
a Taj Mahal of its own!

1676
01:41:54,145 --> 01:41:57,423
But first show my horoscope
to a good astrologer

1677
01:41:57,424 --> 01:41:58,383
The last thing left!

1678
01:41:58,384 --> 01:42:04,185
Every deep love I've had
comes with a nuisance in between

1679
01:42:08,624 --> 01:42:09,825
I want her

1680
01:42:19,704 --> 01:42:21,905
I thought power would tempt him

1681
01:42:22,624 --> 01:42:24,663
Turns out, it's a girl that's got him on edge!

1682
01:42:24,664 --> 01:42:27,624
Don't see her as a threat, sir,
she's our trump card!

1683
01:42:28,505 --> 01:42:30,264
Krishna loves her

1684
01:42:30,265 --> 01:42:31,703
And here's the twist

1685
01:42:31,704 --> 01:42:33,624
Dhanush is crazy about her too

1686
01:42:34,024 --> 01:42:35,063
So?

1687
01:42:35,064 --> 01:42:37,825
No matter how skilled a mahout
is at taming an elephant

1688
01:42:38,424 --> 01:42:41,023
it's the goad, the tool in hand,
that the elephant obeys

1689
01:42:41,024 --> 01:42:43,185
If we use this girl as our tool

1690
01:42:43,465 --> 01:42:47,304
both, wild and the tamed one,
are ours to command

1691
01:42:47,664 --> 01:42:51,344
We parade Krishna for the people
and make Dhanush the CM

1692
01:42:52,185 --> 01:42:53,984
And then let them go their ways

1693
01:42:54,265 --> 01:42:55,944
You really think this'll work?

1694
01:42:56,145 --> 01:42:58,304
My calculation's on point

1695
01:42:59,505 --> 01:43:02,265
The Devil is in love

1696
01:43:15,825 --> 01:43:19,303
"For once, let my love defeat you"

1697
01:43:19,304 --> 01:43:22,465
"Without you saying a word"

1698
01:43:22,704 --> 01:43:26,264
"In the fire of your craving
I'm consumed so deep"

1699
01:43:26,265 --> 01:43:29,585
"My heart grows
countless desires it can't keep"

1700
01:43:30,265 --> 01:43:36,784
"You stirred my heart first,
everything else after"

1701
01:43:36,785 --> 01:43:43,585
"Your love's ways I simply can't capture"

1702
01:43:43,944 --> 01:43:50,544
"No warning, no sign, you rob me clean"

1703
01:43:50,545 --> 01:43:57,105
"Your fiery eyes erupt,
burning my soul unseen"

1704
01:44:25,624 --> 01:44:29,023
"Even if I disappear or I'm forgotten"

1705
01:44:29,024 --> 01:44:32,623
"I'll find my way back,
to the love we begotten"

1706
01:44:32,624 --> 01:44:40,145
"To tell my tales along your gentle neck,
my kisses will get there first"

1707
01:44:40,304 --> 01:44:44,504
"Why are you doing this to me?"

1708
01:44:44,505 --> 01:44:47,624
"Your smile's the one that set a wildfire in me"

1709
01:44:47,944 --> 01:44:50,984
"You're the glow-shine I want so bad now"

1710
01:44:51,384 --> 01:44:54,585
"Dizzy-tipsy on your intoxication, untame"

1711
01:44:54,785 --> 01:44:59,105
"Your fragrance-lit body is mine to claim"

1712
01:44:59,304 --> 01:45:02,663
"For once, let my love defeat you"

1713
01:45:02,664 --> 01:45:05,905
"Without you saying a word"

1714
01:45:06,064 --> 01:45:09,623
"I captured you"

1715
01:45:09,624 --> 01:45:13,064
"but I'm the one caught in your cage"

1716
01:45:32,785 --> 01:45:39,703
"My beauty isn't yours to steal with ease"

1717
01:45:39,704 --> 01:45:46,504
"Change in a way that
my heart loses to you"

1718
01:45:46,505 --> 01:45:49,585
"You struck like thunder,
shook me to the core"

1719
01:45:49,944 --> 01:45:53,024
"You're the reason I've changed,
that's for sure"

1720
01:45:53,465 --> 01:45:56,545
"Dizzy-tipsy on your intoxication, untame"

1721
01:45:56,865 --> 01:46:01,303
"Your fragrance-lit body is mine to claim"

1722
01:46:01,304 --> 01:46:04,623
"For once, let my love defeat you"

1723
01:46:04,624 --> 01:46:07,983
"Without you saying a word"

1724
01:46:07,984 --> 01:46:11,584
"You entered my heart's jungle"

1725
01:46:11,585 --> 01:46:14,704
"Lit it ablaze,
and now your flames haunt me"

1726
01:46:15,384 --> 01:46:22,224
"You stirred my heart first,
everything else after"

1727
01:46:22,225 --> 01:46:28,545
"Your love's ways I simply can't capture"

1728
01:46:45,825 --> 01:46:47,024
Where had you gone?

1729
01:46:48,465 --> 01:46:53,225
Our daughter's still missing, so I had
gone to the police to file a complaint

1730
01:46:54,265 --> 01:46:56,623
Are you out of your mind, huh?

1731
01:46:56,624 --> 01:46:59,465
He and she... both gone!
They've eloped!

1732
01:46:59,944 --> 01:47:01,825
She's not the girl I raised! Curse her!

1733
01:47:02,304 --> 01:47:05,505
So harsh to your own girl for
all that a mother should be?

1734
01:47:07,265 --> 01:47:09,185
This is not me being harsh

1735
01:47:09,905 --> 01:47:11,905
it's just the pain eating me inside

1736
01:47:12,304 --> 01:47:16,423
The moment she walked out that door,
I disowned her!

1737
01:47:16,424 --> 01:47:17,984
You should too, it's only proper!

1738
01:47:37,984 --> 01:47:39,144
Ahhh!

1739
01:47:39,145 --> 01:47:40,105
Huh-huh!

1740
01:47:41,145 --> 01:47:41,744
Leave me!

1741
01:47:42,185 --> 01:47:43,064
Uh?

1742
01:47:46,905 --> 01:47:47,865
Seenu...

1743
01:47:47,984 --> 01:47:49,384
Amma...

1744
01:47:50,744 --> 01:47:51,585
Amma...

1745
01:47:57,944 --> 01:48:00,464
What were you thinking
bringing Rukku here, sir?

1746
01:48:00,465 --> 01:48:02,063
All that talk when you brought me!

1747
01:48:02,064 --> 01:48:03,145
And now this?

1748
01:48:03,424 --> 01:48:05,383
When did Dhanush arrive?

1749
01:48:05,384 --> 01:48:06,545
And why did he hit me, sir?

1750
01:48:06,704 --> 01:48:09,785
Krishna, the more you poke,
the deeper it'll hurt

1751
01:48:10,304 --> 01:48:12,184
I'll answer all your questions

1752
01:48:12,185 --> 01:48:14,023
Just not right now
Wait for the right time

1753
01:48:14,024 --> 01:48:16,983
Pretty sure you won't keep us alive
long enough to see that time!

1754
01:48:16,984 --> 01:48:18,984
I'm taking my Rukku and leaving...
- And go where?

1755
01:48:19,344 --> 01:48:21,145
You think you can step out of here?

1756
01:48:23,664 --> 01:48:24,585
Krishna...

1757
01:48:25,064 --> 01:48:27,064
Your dream, your ambition...

1758
01:48:27,545 --> 01:48:28,704
Have you forgotten them?

1759
01:48:28,905 --> 01:48:31,304
Rukku is more important than my dreams, sir

1760
01:48:31,465 --> 01:48:32,544
I'm done with you, sir!

1761
01:48:32,545 --> 01:48:33,585
Krishna, hear me out

1762
01:48:35,185 --> 01:48:38,105
If you make the teeth pay for biting
the tongue, you’ll lose the joy of eating

1763
01:48:38,865 --> 01:48:42,624
It's on me to keep you safe,
and Rukmini too, not a scratch on her!

1764
01:48:43,344 --> 01:48:44,943
You've made it halfway already

1765
01:48:44,944 --> 01:48:47,624
Forward or back, the distance's the same

1766
01:48:48,505 --> 01:48:51,744
Stick to my words for a few more days
and everything will fall into place

1767
01:48:53,064 --> 01:48:54,225
But still...

1768
01:48:54,585 --> 01:48:56,424
Rukku is petrified, sir

1769
01:48:56,785 --> 01:49:00,225
One word with her will
give me some courage

1770
01:49:00,545 --> 01:49:01,624
Look at your face!

1771
01:49:02,024 --> 01:49:04,865
Get well first, then I'll
make sure you talk to her

1772
01:49:06,145 --> 01:49:08,024
I said it, take my word for it

1773
01:49:10,465 --> 01:49:12,944
Take this, prepare for the speech

1774
01:49:14,825 --> 01:49:15,984
Sir...

1775
01:49:16,185 --> 01:49:17,825
So much going wrong in here

1776
01:49:18,865 --> 01:49:22,465
yet I'm trusting you, sir!

1777
01:49:24,944 --> 01:49:29,104
'Dhanush: Gimmick or Organic?'
Welcome you all to this special program

1778
01:49:29,105 --> 01:49:34,505
People have tumbled so deep for small thrills,
they've lost their sense of perspective

1779
01:49:35,465 --> 01:49:38,983
What he's doing is just
an election stunt, a gimmick!

1780
01:49:38,984 --> 01:49:41,264
I disagree, he's not after publicity

1781
01:49:41,265 --> 01:49:42,544
I can feel the honesty in his work

1782
01:49:42,545 --> 01:49:45,584
He promised separate toilets
for transgenders like me

1783
01:49:45,585 --> 01:49:48,983
and vowed to put us in
the spotlight of society!

1784
01:49:48,984 --> 01:49:50,624
He's not a gimmick, he's real

1785
01:49:50,825 --> 01:49:55,145
Dhanush never pushed religion or caste agendas

1786
01:49:55,384 --> 01:49:58,904
Has Dhanush really made
such a big impact on the people?

1787
01:49:58,905 --> 01:50:00,064
Absolutely, sir!

1788
01:50:00,304 --> 01:50:05,384
I've personally seen him empathize
with people and mingle with children

1789
01:50:05,744 --> 01:50:08,144
The way he talks,
the way he conducts himself

1790
01:50:08,145 --> 01:50:09,343
he's not fake, sir!

1791
01:50:09,344 --> 01:50:10,624
He's truly honest!

1792
01:50:10,865 --> 01:50:12,304
Who's your favourite leader, guys?

1793
01:50:12,424 --> 01:50:13,904
Dhanush Rajashekar!

1794
01:50:13,905 --> 01:50:16,423
Put simply, Dhanush really appeals to us

1795
01:50:16,424 --> 01:50:19,664
Take my word for it, he's the next CM!

1796
01:50:21,064 --> 01:50:25,265
I tell you, forget Dhanush's image
It's that photographer who seems fishy!

1797
01:50:25,865 --> 01:50:29,424
He lied to us,
painted Dhanush as some terror

1798
01:50:30,145 --> 01:50:32,743
And pocketed crores of rupees

1799
01:50:32,744 --> 01:50:36,023
If it's true, why would they
keep Dhanush secretly secluded?

1800
01:50:36,024 --> 01:50:37,265
Whatever it is!

1801
01:50:37,744 --> 01:50:40,064
In the public eye,
Dhanush is already a HERO

1802
01:50:40,344 --> 01:50:42,465
Dhanush can become CM only if he's alive

1803
01:50:42,664 --> 01:50:43,784
what if he's taken out?

1804
01:50:43,785 --> 01:50:45,024
Don't start acting like a thug

1805
01:50:45,984 --> 01:50:48,545
I won't agree to this,
nor will I support it!

1806
01:50:49,185 --> 01:50:50,983
You! Get out of here!

1807
01:50:50,984 --> 01:50:52,704
Who the hell asked for your
approval and support? Keep it!

1808
01:50:53,785 --> 01:50:55,384
For being in company like yours

1809
01:50:55,984 --> 01:50:57,664
I should whack myself with my own slippers!

1810
01:50:58,825 --> 01:50:59,704
Hmph!

1811
01:50:59,984 --> 01:51:01,105
Mr. Patil

1812
01:51:02,265 --> 01:51:06,105
Mark my words:
I'll make my brother the CM

1813
01:51:06,664 --> 01:51:08,384
And you'll watch it with your own eyes

1814
01:51:08,944 --> 01:51:10,704
Your highness!

1815
01:51:13,585 --> 01:51:14,785
It's me only!

1816
01:51:15,704 --> 01:51:17,624
Your sweet little devil here

1817
01:51:18,185 --> 01:51:25,983
badly wants to take his
soon-to-be wife Rukmini, on a long drive!

1818
01:51:25,984 --> 01:51:27,024
Over my dead body!

1819
01:51:28,064 --> 01:51:29,544
Not yours

1820
01:51:29,545 --> 01:51:31,825
It's that costume hero of
yours I've got plans for

1821
01:51:33,304 --> 01:51:34,545
Krishna...

1822
01:52:06,905 --> 01:52:09,585
Boss! Dhanush is heading out
without security!

1823
01:52:27,944 --> 01:52:29,224
Show him who's Boss!

1824
01:52:29,225 --> 01:52:31,344
Open the damn door!
- Get out! Now!

1825
01:52:31,545 --> 01:52:34,384
They don't even let us have
a romantic moment in peace!

1826
01:52:34,984 --> 01:52:36,664
Now, just watch me handle this!

1827
01:52:36,785 --> 01:52:37,865
Get the hell out!

1828
01:53:15,905 --> 01:53:17,423
'Yeah, looks-wise he's a hero'

1829
01:53:17,424 --> 01:53:20,624
'but when he's high,
he's full-on terror!'

1830
01:53:20,825 --> 01:53:24,785
'In one line,
he's a monster in human form'

1831
01:53:26,865 --> 01:53:29,145
You follow me everywhere!

1832
01:53:30,664 --> 01:53:32,225
What is your damn problem, huh?

1833
01:54:44,545 --> 01:54:45,704
Shhh!

1834
01:55:55,944 --> 01:55:57,584
Dhanush, leave me!

1835
01:55:57,585 --> 01:55:58,785
Let go of me!

1836
01:56:01,265 --> 01:56:02,424
Hey Dhanush...

1837
01:56:04,265 --> 01:56:05,224
Hey...

1838
01:56:05,225 --> 01:56:06,624
O-Open the door, Dhanush!

1839
01:56:06,865 --> 01:56:08,024
Dhanush!

1840
01:56:08,384 --> 01:56:09,344
Open, Dhanush!

1841
01:56:10,064 --> 01:56:10,905
Dhanush!

1842
01:56:11,585 --> 01:56:12,744
Dhanush, hey! Ugh!

1843
01:56:29,785 --> 01:56:31,105
Hey no, Dhanush!

1844
01:56:31,984 --> 01:56:34,024
Hey, open the door, Dhanush!

1845
01:56:34,344 --> 01:56:36,105
Dhanush, please, don't harm me!

1846
01:56:36,424 --> 01:56:37,584
Please no!

1847
01:56:37,585 --> 01:56:40,304
Hey Dhanush, stop! Open the door!

1848
01:56:40,465 --> 01:56:42,505
Hey, no!

1849
01:56:55,225 --> 01:56:57,063
Hey.. Dha..nush...

1850
01:56:57,064 --> 01:57:02,023
In the tragic accident that happened yesterday,
young leader Janardhan lost his life...

1851
01:57:02,024 --> 01:57:04,303
His gunmen too died on the spot

1852
01:57:04,304 --> 01:57:08,024
Police are working to confirm
the identities of the dead

1853
01:57:08,225 --> 01:57:09,063
Sir!

1854
01:57:09,064 --> 01:57:10,545
Respect, sir
- Respect, sir

1855
01:57:24,185 --> 01:57:25,264
Brother... how cruel!

1856
01:57:25,265 --> 01:57:27,545
I didn't even see my boy's face one last time!

1857
01:57:28,785 --> 01:57:33,304
You know very well what
your brother's like in politics!

1858
01:57:35,225 --> 01:57:36,545
These sons of yours...

1859
01:57:36,704 --> 01:57:38,664
Buying off the judge

1860
01:57:39,825 --> 01:57:41,744
and following Dhanush everywhere

1861
01:57:42,185 --> 01:57:43,624
Did they need all this?

1862
01:57:44,744 --> 01:57:46,304
He's the only child left for you

1863
01:57:47,424 --> 01:57:48,704
Take care of him

1864
01:57:53,984 --> 01:57:57,303
Hey mister, stop!
Barging in like a wild buffalo!

1865
01:57:57,304 --> 01:57:58,585
You need permission first!

1866
01:57:59,105 --> 01:58:01,824
Name's Shankar
CBI Shankar

1867
01:58:01,825 --> 01:58:04,024
Uff! Bloody climate!

1868
01:58:05,424 --> 01:58:08,225
Excuse me, constable
Turn on that AC, too much heat

1869
01:58:08,944 --> 01:58:11,825
Constable?! You're talking to the IG!
Who are you, huh?

1870
01:58:12,064 --> 01:58:13,104
Get the hell up!

1871
01:58:13,105 --> 01:58:15,023
Name's Shankar
CBI Shankar

1872
01:58:15,024 --> 01:58:17,104
Ohh sorry sir, really sorry

1873
01:58:17,105 --> 01:58:19,023
Would you like something to drink?

1874
01:58:19,024 --> 01:58:20,825
No need, I'm already full!

1875
01:58:21,265 --> 01:58:22,905
Sir, how can we help you?

1876
01:58:25,744 --> 01:58:27,664
A highly confidential matter

1877
01:58:28,465 --> 01:58:30,585
Dhanush Rajashekar's not one person, but TWO

1878
01:58:32,424 --> 01:58:34,225
You are absolutely right, sir

1879
01:58:34,465 --> 01:58:35,785
I had the exact same doubt!

1880
01:58:35,984 --> 01:58:39,145
On stage he's sugar,
in office he's salt!

1881
01:58:39,344 --> 01:58:40,944
It's all politics

1882
01:58:41,064 --> 01:58:43,825
He's one thing,
the other is entirely another

1883
01:58:44,424 --> 01:58:46,064
He said the same thing

1884
01:58:46,185 --> 01:58:49,064
but I never thought it would
escalate to CBI-level, sir!

1885
01:58:49,265 --> 01:58:51,464
Don't get shocked yet, IG baby!

1886
01:58:51,465 --> 01:58:52,744
Keep that gun in hand, just in case

1887
01:58:52,865 --> 01:58:53,704
Why, sir?

1888
01:58:53,905 --> 01:58:55,064
Keep it ready, I say!

1889
01:58:57,585 --> 01:59:02,544
My next reveal may give you a seizure,
so precaution!

1890
01:59:02,545 --> 01:59:03,545
Okay, sir

1891
01:59:04,064 --> 01:59:05,905
Ambareesh Anna isn't dead, he's alive

1892
01:59:06,024 --> 01:59:07,145
Huh?!

1893
01:59:07,304 --> 01:59:08,744
Hmm, IG baby!

1894
01:59:09,225 --> 01:59:11,383
Ambareesh Anna... is alive?!

1895
01:59:11,384 --> 01:59:14,184
Hmm, IG baby!
Saw him with my own eyes

1896
01:59:14,185 --> 01:59:17,184
He's shooting for 'Antha 3'
under Uppi sir's direction

1897
01:59:17,185 --> 01:59:17,944
Ah!

1898
01:59:18,265 --> 01:59:21,585
I, CBI Shankar, swear to
tell only the truth, nothing else!

1899
01:59:21,785 --> 01:59:22,664
I see!

1900
01:59:23,944 --> 01:59:26,505
What the hell kind of CBI officer are you?
- Ouch!

1901
01:59:27,424 --> 01:59:29,265
Canara Bank Colony, Ittamadu

1902
01:59:29,585 --> 01:59:32,064
It's hurting, sir
Please!

1903
01:59:33,105 --> 01:59:34,505
You rascal!

1904
01:59:34,624 --> 01:59:38,544
I forgot I'm the IG, and all this while I was
showing respect to a drunkard like you!

1905
01:59:38,545 --> 01:59:40,343
Damn you, moron!
- Sir, please... No!

1906
01:59:40,344 --> 01:59:41,864
You call yourself 'CBI' Shankar, huh?
- You're taking the law into your own hands here!

1907
01:59:41,865 --> 01:59:43,023
Ambareesh Anna...
- This is wrong as per the IPC section...

1908
01:59:43,024 --> 01:59:44,265
How dare you talk IPC section to me!

1909
01:59:44,664 --> 01:59:46,184
Ma'am, stop please

1910
01:59:46,185 --> 01:59:47,663
Ma'am, listen to me

1911
01:59:47,664 --> 01:59:48,304
Ma'am...

1912
01:59:48,704 --> 01:59:49,664
What the hell!

1913
01:59:50,225 --> 01:59:51,865
What did you promise me,
and what have you done?

1914
01:59:52,105 --> 01:59:54,825
You better give me that ticket
and the president's post

1915
01:59:55,064 --> 01:59:57,024
Or the consequences will be ugly!

1916
01:59:58,344 --> 01:59:59,504
Don't scream here

1917
01:59:59,505 --> 02:00:00,623
Let's sort this inside

1918
02:00:00,624 --> 02:00:04,105
Think you can pacify me
and push me out, no way!

1919
02:00:04,424 --> 02:00:06,865
I want my ticket announced
Right here right now

1920
02:00:07,304 --> 02:00:08,344
Or else...

1921
02:00:08,664 --> 02:00:10,743
Aware what you're speaking
and whom you're speaking to?

1922
02:00:10,744 --> 02:00:13,905
I agreed to that compromise,
not to give him pleasure!

1923
02:00:14,585 --> 02:00:16,704
But to accelerate my political career!

1924
02:00:17,024 --> 02:00:21,225
Fail me and I'll expose you to the media
and ruin you!

1925
02:00:21,704 --> 02:00:25,224
You behaved like that in the restroom,
but now your mouth's shut, huh?

1926
02:00:25,225 --> 02:00:27,064
You...

1927
02:00:28,024 --> 02:00:29,424
Huh?!

1928
02:00:35,105 --> 02:00:36,785
You're so damn loud!

1929
02:00:37,185 --> 02:00:38,465
Nonsense!

1930
02:00:49,545 --> 02:00:51,825
I could hear her ranting

1931
02:00:52,624 --> 02:00:55,984
Hate it when my sleep gets ruined, Uncs

1932
02:00:56,424 --> 02:00:58,424
Gun's your only language, huh?

1933
02:00:59,785 --> 02:01:03,865
Be glad I didn't take you out
in my sleepy haze, Uncs!

1934
02:01:04,865 --> 02:01:06,545
She's the women's wing leader

1935
02:01:06,944 --> 02:01:08,505
Why kill her, of all people?

1936
02:01:08,664 --> 02:01:12,303
Oh please! Like I did something
your CM and you haven't already!

1937
02:01:12,304 --> 02:01:13,825
Have her cleared, Uncs!

1938
02:01:14,664 --> 02:01:18,825
By the way, my friends are
coming down from London

1939
02:01:19,225 --> 02:01:23,865
Gotta introduce MY Rukmini to all of them

1940
02:01:26,105 --> 02:01:28,624
Arrange a party for that, Uncs

1941
02:01:29,064 --> 02:01:30,185
Security...

1942
02:01:37,024 --> 02:01:38,064
Krishna...

1943
02:01:39,105 --> 02:01:40,024
Krishna...

1944
02:01:40,905 --> 02:01:42,384
What the hell is this guy, sir?

1945
02:01:42,664 --> 02:01:45,545
He killed her more cruelly
than they would an animal

1946
02:01:46,185 --> 02:01:50,145
All this time I was acting...
for a monster like him, seriously?

1947
02:01:51,145 --> 02:01:54,343
I don't want this, sir!
I'm really scared, please!

1948
02:01:54,344 --> 02:01:55,544
I can't do this anymore, sir!
- Krishna...

1949
02:01:55,545 --> 02:01:56,865
You said you wanted to see Rukmini, right?

1950
02:01:57,785 --> 02:01:58,944
Yes, sir, please...

1951
02:01:59,465 --> 02:02:00,704
