Rukku.. I-It's me...

1953
02:02:15,304 --> 02:02:16,145
Krishna...

1954
02:02:26,785 --> 02:02:30,344
Krishna... I thought I'd die
without seeing you again

1955
02:02:34,424 --> 02:02:36,545
What's happening here, Krishna?

1956
02:02:36,664 --> 02:02:38,984
What are you doing with these monsters?

1957
02:02:40,704 --> 02:02:42,545
It was my dream to become an actor

1958
02:02:43,384 --> 02:02:47,384
He came, told me to act like the CM's son,
and promised to make me a hero

1959
02:02:47,744 --> 02:02:51,343
But what's happening here
is something else altogether, Rukku

1960
02:02:51,344 --> 02:02:55,105
Krishna, you accepted it blindly,
just because someone lured you into it?

1961
02:02:56,064 --> 02:03:02,265
When you're starving, all you see is the food,
not the hand that feeds

1962
02:03:02,785 --> 02:03:06,984
Years I waited for one break

1963
02:03:07,465 --> 02:03:09,704
and when someone came saying,
'I'll make you a hero'

1964
02:03:11,105 --> 02:03:13,224
my judgment failed me, Rukku!

1965
02:03:13,225 --> 02:03:15,344
You got betrayed by someone you trusted

1966
02:03:15,704 --> 02:03:17,225
And I got betrayed by trusting you, Krishna

1967
02:03:17,545 --> 02:03:20,944
I left my family for you,
but you weren't there

1968
02:03:21,704 --> 02:03:25,225
I spoke to you, thinking it was you,
it wasn't you at all

1969
02:03:25,785 --> 02:03:28,984
Each time I came to you with hope,
I was betrayed, Krishna

1970
02:03:31,585 --> 02:03:36,145
The girl I love with all my heart
is suffering so much... all because of me!

1971
02:03:39,744 --> 02:03:41,664
Please forgive me, Rukku

1972
02:03:42,265 --> 02:03:43,984
Please forgive me

1973
02:03:45,145 --> 02:03:46,225
Krishna...

1974
02:03:46,384 --> 02:03:48,304
All this time together, and we never...

1975
02:03:48,984 --> 02:03:53,744
And now, in all this mess,
this is where we're opening up our love!

