make it out of that hell alive

2028
02:07:52,984 --> 02:07:55,064
But at last, we made it

2029
02:08:18,024 --> 02:08:19,225
Let go of me!

2030
02:08:20,024 --> 02:08:20,865
Leave me!

2031
02:08:22,545 --> 02:08:25,584
Even with a performance worthy of an Oscar

2032
02:08:25,585 --> 02:08:28,024
you still figured me out!

2033
02:08:28,865 --> 02:08:29,704
Let me go!

2034
02:08:30,384 --> 02:08:31,505
Shhh!

2035
02:08:33,465 --> 02:08:36,024
Let's elope somewhere, far far away!

2036
02:08:37,984 --> 02:08:40,663
Imagine: a small thatched hut atop a hill

2037
02:08:40,664 --> 02:08:41,623
Leave me!

2038
02:08:41,624 --> 02:08:45,063
I'll ride autorickshaw all day,
earning our bread

2039
02:08:45,064 --> 02:08:45,703
Leave me!

2040
02:08:45,704 --> 02:08:48,744
And you in that hut, cute as ever,
taking care of our home

2041
02:08:49,265 --> 02:08:53,145
Us, raising three, maybe four
little devil kids together!

2042
02:08:53,545 --> 02:08:56,545
Aha! What an imagination!

2043
02:08:56,905 --> 02:09:01,303
The one who set heaven ablaze, the Devil!

2044
02:09:01,304 --> 02:09:02,225
[lever click]

2045
02:09:02,545 --> 02:09:04,383
Wow, wow, wow!
- Who are you people?

2046
02:09:04,384 --> 02:09:05,743
Leave me!
- Heard that? Proves it's true

2047
02:09:05,744 --> 02:09:07,265
Who the hell are you two?

2048
02:09:07,984 --> 02:09:10,105
How did you even get in here?
Get out, both of you!

2049
02:09:10,465 --> 02:09:11,624
Out now, before I lose it!

2050
02:09:12,024 --> 02:09:13,023
Huh?!

2051
02:09:13,024 --> 02:09:16,424
Sir... y-you're Dhanush...

2052
02:09:24,744 --> 02:09:26,184
Shall we get married?

2053
02:09:26,185 --> 02:09:27,265
Over my dead body!

2054
02:09:29,664 --> 02:09:33,905
I thought desire is asked for,
not taken by force

2055
02:09:34,545 --> 02:09:35,785
But...

2056
02:09:36,064 --> 02:09:39,304
This world's no place for goodness, right?

2057
02:09:41,825 --> 02:09:43,184
Let me go!
Krishna!

2058
02:09:43,185 --> 02:09:44,145
Hmm!

2059
02:09:48,265 --> 02:09:49,064
Please leave me!

2060
02:09:49,865 --> 02:09:50,943
Hello, what happened?

2061
02:09:50,944 --> 02:09:52,224
Sir, they are both missing

2062
02:09:52,225 --> 02:09:53,264
You idiot!

2063
02:09:53,265 --> 02:09:54,384
What the hell were you doing?

2064
02:09:54,664 --> 02:09:55,744
Go and search!

2065
02:10:00,825 --> 02:10:02,144
KRISHNA!

2066
02:10:02,145 --> 02:10:04,825
Let me go! Please!

2067
02:10:08,624 --> 02:10:09,664
Krishna!

2068
02:11:07,344 --> 02:11:08,384
You!

2069
02:11:09,304 --> 02:11:10,664
Leave Rukku!

2070
02:13:15,424 --> 02:13:16,225
Krishna...

2071
02:13:45,944 --> 02:13:46,905
Krishna!

2072
02:13:57,825 --> 02:13:59,265
Mmm!

2073
02:14:59,105 --> 02:15:01,024
Krishna, come on, let's go

2074
02:15:01,304 --> 02:15:02,504
Come, Krishna...
- Uh...

2075
02:15:02,505 --> 02:15:04,704
Let him be gone for good!
Come on, Krishna, let's go

2076
02:15:20,145 --> 02:15:22,383
Sleep, my baby love!

2077
02:15:22,384 --> 02:15:24,464
Hush, my tiny star!

2078
02:15:24,465 --> 02:15:26,464
Why're you crying so much today?

2079
02:15:26,465 --> 02:15:28,024
Shall I sing you a verse?

2080
02:15:28,145 --> 02:15:31,663
'Here comes Dhanush, God's own man!'

2081
02:15:31,664 --> 02:15:33,104
'The pure vessel of our land's faith...'

2082
02:15:33,105 --> 02:15:36,265
You've made that man a god now, huh!

2083
02:15:36,545 --> 02:15:42,623
Tell me, if that man wins,
you think he'll hand you bundles of notes?

2084
02:15:42,624 --> 02:15:46,384
I didn't mean he'll hand us money!

2085
02:15:46,505 --> 02:15:48,423
I meant he'll give us a
way to earn our bread!

2086
02:15:48,424 --> 02:15:49,303
Oh is it?

2087
02:15:49,304 --> 02:15:52,825
Even in a golden rule,
I know slogging's our daily story

2088
02:15:53,384 --> 02:15:56,824
but if Dhanush Anna wins

2089
02:15:56,825 --> 02:15:58,704
our pots won't run short of grains!

2090
02:15:59,024 --> 02:16:01,424
You trust him that much?

2091
02:16:01,664 --> 02:16:03,545
Hmm, of course

2092
02:16:04,185 --> 02:16:07,663
Just like how a baby's safe
in its mother's womb

2093
02:16:07,664 --> 02:16:12,105
I'm sure our child's future will
be bright in Dhanush Anna's care

2094
02:16:12,344 --> 02:16:14,585
That's why I made the
baby swing with his photo

2095
02:16:14,984 --> 02:16:18,465
and had him name our child

2096
02:16:22,344 --> 02:16:24,344
Krishna! Let's go away, now!

2097
02:16:24,664 --> 02:16:26,104
Where?

2098
02:16:26,105 --> 02:16:29,624
Anywhere, but just far away from all this!
Come on, Krishna

2099
02:16:31,265 --> 02:16:33,824
Why should we run scared of someone else?

2100
02:16:37,743 --> 02:16:39,384
To live our own lives, Krishna!

2101
02:16:39,865 --> 02:16:44,344
For our lives, you want me to leave the
people who trust me to that sinner, Rukku?

2102
02:16:45,704 --> 02:16:48,144
Krishna, all that was just acting, right?

2103
02:16:48,145 --> 02:16:49,464
Come on, Krishna, let's go!

2104
02:16:49,465 --> 02:16:50,465
No, Rukku

2105
02:16:51,423 --> 02:16:56,344
I've played the part so well, the people now believe
Dhanush Rajashekar is a very good man

2106
02:16:57,505 --> 02:17:01,265
How can we live in peace after
betraying so many people?

2107
02:17:01,585 --> 02:17:04,624
Please no, Krishna,
those people are monsters!

2108
02:17:04,743 --> 02:17:06,423
They'll go to any damn extent, Krishna

2109
02:17:06,545 --> 02:17:07,585
Let's go away, Krishna

2110
02:17:08,105 --> 02:17:11,505
My life isn't above the lives that trust me

2111
02:17:12,423 --> 02:17:17,064
They're not in my head,
they live in my heart

2112
02:17:24,465 --> 02:17:26,704
Rukku, go home

2113
02:17:26,984 --> 02:17:28,185
What are you saying?

2114
02:17:30,265 --> 02:17:32,064
You trust me, don't you?

2115
02:17:36,145 --> 02:17:38,585
Who else can I trust but you, Krishna?

2116
02:17:39,064 --> 02:17:40,344
Then do what I say

2117
02:17:42,344 --> 02:17:43,743
Now go home

2118
02:17:45,304 --> 02:17:46,265
Hmm

2119
02:18:10,304 --> 02:18:15,023
"Even the scorching sun melts"

2120
02:18:15,024 --> 02:18:19,464
"That's the kind of love you gave,
over and over"

2121
02:18:19,465 --> 02:18:23,865
"Doom bows its head before you"

2122
02:18:24,105 --> 02:18:28,464
"Let millions of breaths
stand strong at your back"

2123
02:18:28,465 --> 02:18:32,743
"No empire can stand when
the Sultan rises to challenge"

2124
02:18:33,225 --> 02:18:37,623
"For every stride you take,
this soil crowns you with honour"

2125
02:18:37,624 --> 02:18:42,184
"History... Remember who you are, rise without pride
don't fall in sorrow, just shine forever"

2126
02:18:42,185 --> 02:18:46,903
"Your fury... Fear nothing, hold firm
the strength of the people is your armor"

2127
02:18:46,904 --> 02:18:51,784
"Through the storms that
carve the chronicles of time"

2128
02:18:51,785 --> 02:18:56,383
"Without you, we your people, cannot be!"

2129
02:18:56,384 --> 02:19:00,865
"Where you set your feet,
the world stands as one"

2130
02:19:00,984 --> 02:19:05,344
"May all our years be yours!"

2131
02:19:29,704 --> 02:19:33,703
Dhanush appearing all alone in a village

2132
02:19:33,704 --> 02:19:36,184
could there be an election motive behind this?

2133
02:19:36,185 --> 02:19:40,943
He sits quietly, not responding
to the people or the public

2134
02:19:40,944 --> 02:19:42,464
makes no sense as a campaign trick

2135
02:19:42,465 --> 02:19:46,785
"Fear nothing, hold firm
the strength of the people is your armor"

2136
02:19:46,904 --> 02:19:51,504
"Through the storms that
carve the chronicles of time"

2137
02:19:51,505 --> 02:19:55,944
"Without you, we your people, cannot be!"

2138
02:19:56,145 --> 02:20:01,023
"Where you set your feet,
the world stands as one"

2139
02:20:01,024 --> 02:20:05,505
"May all our years be yours!"

2140
02:20:11,825 --> 02:20:12,744
All hail!

2141
02:20:12,905 --> 02:20:13,984
All hail Dhanush Anna!

2142
02:20:14,185 --> 02:20:17,104
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

2143
02:20:17,105 --> 02:20:18,584
All hail Dhanush Anna!

2144
02:20:18,585 --> 02:20:20,064
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

2145
02:20:34,984 --> 02:20:36,624
Hey, not now!

2146
02:20:37,384 --> 02:20:39,304
Uh, listen, what's done is done

2147
02:20:40,265 --> 02:20:42,024
But at least you showed up
respecting my words

2148
02:20:42,585 --> 02:20:44,344
I didn't come here
out of respect for your words

2149
02:20:45,145 --> 02:20:48,024
I've come to give you
a clarity on my capacity!

2150
02:20:48,624 --> 02:20:50,104
Krishna, hear me out...

2151
02:20:50,105 --> 02:20:52,984
I'm done with my "yes boss" days

2152
02:20:53,664 --> 02:20:55,984
From today, you'll be the
ones saying "yes boss" to me

2153
02:20:56,225 --> 02:20:57,105
Hey no!

2154
02:20:57,785 --> 02:20:59,145
You once said

2155
02:20:59,505 --> 02:21:03,384
'When your presence itself pulls a crowd,
that day you're a hero'

2156
02:21:04,384 --> 02:21:08,344
Now, not my presence,
just my poster's enough

2157
02:21:08,944 --> 02:21:10,064
to pull the crowd!

2158
02:21:10,704 --> 02:21:14,185
Where I hold my ground,
they swarm to me with cameras

2159
02:21:15,545 --> 02:21:18,225
I didn't pull off any of this with money

2160
02:21:18,905 --> 02:21:21,304
It's what I earned through my character

2161
02:21:22,344 --> 02:21:24,624
I'm someone who came with no background

2162
02:21:25,465 --> 02:21:28,105
and rose only on my talent

2163
02:21:29,304 --> 02:21:35,145
I'm not some cheap tyre that goes flat
I'm a bulldozer!

2164
02:21:42,024 --> 02:21:43,424
Yes, I'm a hero

2165
02:21:45,905 --> 02:21:47,225
Why you staring at me?

2166
02:21:50,465 --> 02:21:52,585
Take a good look at this face

2167
02:21:52,944 --> 02:21:56,343
From today, if I shave my moustache,
you'll shave yours

2168
02:21:56,344 --> 02:21:58,545
If I go bald, you'll go bald too

2169
02:21:59,744 --> 02:22:01,905
I'm done being like you

2170
02:22:02,225 --> 02:22:04,024
now on, you'll be the one like me!

2171
02:22:11,105 --> 02:22:12,744
Krishna, listen to me

2172
02:22:13,076 --> 02:22:14,437
You.. listen to me

2173
02:22:14,624 --> 02:22:16,184
Where's tomorrow's rally?

2174
02:22:16,185 --> 02:22:16,984
JP Nagar

2175
02:22:17,145 --> 02:22:18,304
Shift it to Gandhinagar

2176
02:22:18,585 --> 02:22:19,703
Krishna, everything's alrea-

2177
02:22:19,704 --> 02:22:20,865
Do as I said, sir!

2178
02:22:21,424 --> 02:22:22,983
My phone...

2179
02:22:22,984 --> 02:22:23,744
Phone...

2180
02:22:24,545 --> 02:22:25,424
Hmm

2181
02:22:26,905 --> 02:22:27,743
Krishna...

2182
02:22:27,744 --> 02:22:29,865
Krishna, you're forgetting
your cinema hero dream

2183
02:22:30,185 --> 02:22:34,145
At least hereafter, use that knowledge
and wit of yours for something good

2184
02:22:36,825 --> 02:22:38,343
- Nani...
- Hello

2185
02:22:38,344 --> 02:22:39,864
Come tomorrow
Reopen the mess

2186
02:22:39,865 --> 02:22:41,623
Uh... Super, Boss!

2187
02:22:41,624 --> 02:22:42,545
Coming, Boss!

2188
02:22:53,304 --> 02:22:56,264
'Believed the formula was mine to make,
the role was mine to write'

2189
02:22:56,265 --> 02:23:00,105
'I reigned like everything danced at my fingertips,
like I was the Brahma in command'

2190
02:23:00,545 --> 02:23:03,105
'Then came one girl
and turned my world into illusion'

2191
02:23:03,465 --> 02:23:06,544
'The kingmaker in me failed to see'

2192
02:23:06,545 --> 02:23:10,744
'that even Ramayana and Mahabharata
bent their course to a woman's will'

2193
02:23:31,465 --> 02:23:34,064
All hail youth icon Dhanush Rajashekar!

2194
02:23:34,225 --> 02:23:36,623
All hail the next CM Dhanush Rajashekar!

2195
02:23:36,624 --> 02:23:37,663
'Krishna's mess'

2196
02:23:37,664 --> 02:23:38,905
Hey, move!

2197
02:23:39,105 --> 02:23:40,984
All hail!

2198
02:23:41,465 --> 02:23:43,865
All hail!
- All hail!

2199
02:23:44,024 --> 02:23:44,905
All hail!

2200
02:23:45,664 --> 02:23:46,905
All hail!

2201
02:23:47,624 --> 02:23:49,344
All hail!
- Rangamma, let's go back in

2202
02:23:49,465 --> 02:23:51,264
Looks like our Boss, doesn't he?

2203
02:23:51,265 --> 02:23:52,784
All hail Dhanush Rajashekar!

2204
02:23:52,785 --> 02:23:55,304
All hail the next CM Dhanush Rajashekar!

2205
02:24:02,545 --> 02:24:03,384
Hi!

2206
02:24:07,545 --> 02:24:09,064
[Explosion]

2207
02:24:26,185 --> 02:24:27,785
[Panicked voices]

2208
02:24:28,344 --> 02:24:29,225
Please help!

2209
02:24:36,744 --> 02:24:38,624
Anna!

2210
02:24:39,704 --> 02:24:40,384
Oh no!

2211
02:24:46,744 --> 02:24:47,785
Hand over the children, sir!

2212
02:24:48,825 --> 02:24:50,303
Hey, stop!
- Don't go!

2213
02:24:50,304 --> 02:24:51,905
Take him, Anna!
- Oh no!

2214
02:24:52,744 --> 02:24:54,905
Please help! Somebody help!

2215
02:24:55,704 --> 02:24:57,063
Come on, lady, move out now!

2216
02:24:57,064 --> 02:24:58,224
Brother, Nani...

2217
02:24:58,225 --> 02:24:59,825
I'll get him, you move out first!

2218
02:25:05,704 --> 02:25:06,505
Nani...

2219
02:25:06,664 --> 02:25:07,624
Nani...

2220
02:25:08,384 --> 02:25:09,544
Hey Nani!

2221
02:25:09,545 --> 02:25:10,225
Nani!

2222
02:25:10,664 --> 02:25:11,944
N-Nani!
- Sir...

2223
02:25:12,465 --> 02:25:14,264
S-Sir...

2224
02:25:14,265 --> 02:25:18,104
M-My boss... he looks just like you...

2225
02:25:18,105 --> 02:25:19,624
Nani, it's me...

2226
02:25:27,785 --> 02:25:28,664
Nani...

2227
02:25:29,744 --> 02:25:30,624
Nani...

2228
02:25:32,505 --> 02:25:33,744
Hey NANI!

2229
02:25:34,344 --> 02:25:35,105
Nani!

2230
02:25:35,344 --> 02:25:36,185
Hey Nani!

2231
02:25:53,304 --> 02:25:56,505
'From ladle to cutout,
what a jump it'll be!'

2232
02:26:08,585 --> 02:26:10,024
Stand right there!

2233
02:26:31,265 --> 02:26:32,545
'Breaking news!'

2234
02:26:33,024 --> 02:26:36,424
'Risked his own life to save many'

2235
02:26:37,064 --> 02:26:38,944
'Dhanush Rajashekar!'

2236
02:26:39,185 --> 02:26:41,225
Welcome, costume-hero!

2237
02:26:42,145 --> 02:26:45,304
That BOOM at your mess?

2238
02:26:45,704 --> 02:26:47,785
You think a gas cylinder leak did that?

2239
02:26:49,624 --> 02:26:50,984
Nah nah!

2240
02:26:51,744 --> 02:26:53,943
It's...

2241
02:26:53,944 --> 02:26:55,944
...the Devil's job!

2242
02:27:00,465 --> 02:27:02,105
You filthy scum!

2243
02:27:03,064 --> 02:27:05,064
If you were a real man

2244
02:27:06,704 --> 02:27:08,905
you'd fight me face-to-face

2245
02:27:09,825 --> 02:27:12,743
Not play with innocent lives, like a coward!

2246
02:27:12,744 --> 02:27:13,464
Krishna!

2247
02:27:13,465 --> 02:27:14,584
Krishna, what are you doing?

2248
02:27:14,585 --> 02:27:15,303
Let go of him, Krishna!

2249
02:27:15,304 --> 02:27:17,224
Krishna, hear me out, don't mess it all up

2250
02:27:17,225 --> 02:27:18,825
Hands off! Krishna, stop!

2251
02:27:23,105 --> 02:27:28,145
I saw you as my father...
more than that, as God himself!

2252
02:27:28,984 --> 02:27:34,105
Forget being God,
you couldn't even be a human, sir

2253
02:27:36,744 --> 02:27:39,944
What did you say?
You called him father?

2254
02:27:43,105 --> 02:27:45,825
When he's never been a father
in personal life itself

2255
02:27:46,344 --> 02:27:48,905
how's he supposed to feel that emotion, huh?

2256
02:27:51,225 --> 02:27:53,704
Try all you want

2257
02:27:54,465 --> 02:27:57,624
The lap Rukmini sits on is - MINE

2258
02:27:59,064 --> 02:28:02,545
the right to sit in CM's chair is also MINE

2259
02:28:04,304 --> 02:28:06,664
Just wait till this election's over, Costume-hero!

2260
02:28:08,105 --> 02:28:11,424
Game over, drama finished!

2261
02:28:11,785 --> 02:28:13,225
You lowlife!

2262
02:28:14,424 --> 02:28:16,424
Krishna's not just flute and tune

2263
02:28:16,944 --> 02:28:19,704
he's got the conch of war too!

2264
02:28:21,585 --> 02:28:23,145
Just wait till this election's over

2265
02:28:23,465 --> 02:28:26,865
The Krishna in me will
show you his universal form!

2266
02:28:27,984 --> 02:28:31,344
In the name of opportunity,
you made me your play piece

2267
02:28:33,585 --> 02:28:35,624
Request all you want

2268
02:28:36,145 --> 02:28:37,505
no way I'm retiring!

2269
02:28:40,064 --> 02:28:43,344
I won't rest till I sit and rule

2270
02:28:50,545 --> 02:28:51,743
Game on!

2271
02:28:51,744 --> 02:28:52,905
[Laughing]

2272
02:28:54,225 --> 02:28:57,145
What's happening, sir?
None of this was in our plan!

2273
02:28:58,785 --> 02:29:01,505
My son's turned into a real politician now!

2274
02:29:02,225 --> 02:29:03,704
You were the one who kept saying

2275
02:29:04,225 --> 02:29:06,944
That the game's in "our" hands

2276
02:29:07,545 --> 02:29:08,344
No

2277
02:29:08,984 --> 02:29:11,225
It's in Dhanush's hands now

2278
02:29:11,984 --> 02:29:16,744
Finally he learnt, that to bring tears,
one must first plant fear deep in their bones

2279
02:29:17,624 --> 02:29:19,505
Sir, I don't feel right about this

2280
02:29:19,664 --> 02:29:20,743
You!

2281
02:29:20,744 --> 02:29:23,185
I don't keep you around for your morals

2282
02:29:24,265 --> 02:29:26,424
I keep you because
you know my weakness!

2283
02:29:28,545 --> 02:29:32,785
Try being over smart, and your
house cylinder is next to blow!

2284
02:29:35,865 --> 02:29:39,304
With a death in air,
the sympathy votes will swing our way

2285
02:29:44,344 --> 02:29:45,505
What's bothering you?

2286
02:29:46,384 --> 02:29:49,785
I betrayed a young man
who placed his trust in me

2287
02:29:50,704 --> 02:29:54,664
He saw me as a father,
and even more

2288
02:29:56,024 --> 02:29:59,624
But I used that trust for my own gain

2289
02:30:00,344 --> 02:30:06,905
One life I shattered,
another I sent to the grave

2290
02:30:08,865 --> 02:30:10,545
You know why we never had children?

2291
02:30:12,344 --> 02:30:13,265
It's just...

2292
02:30:13,424 --> 02:30:15,865
The doctor told us you can't conceive

2293
02:30:16,145 --> 02:30:17,225
He didn't say it

2294
02:30:19,145 --> 02:30:20,104
I made him say it

2295
02:30:20,105 --> 02:30:20,984
Janaki!

2296
02:30:21,585 --> 02:30:23,145
No matter how educated I am

2297
02:30:23,865 --> 02:30:28,545
I still believe, children carry the fruits
of their parents' virtues and sins

2298
02:30:28,825 --> 02:30:30,585
You've been a good husband, no doubt

2299
02:30:30,785 --> 02:30:36,785
But in the name of your pride and existence,
you've committed countless sins

2300
02:30:37,304 --> 02:30:40,344
And yet you never thought to ask me once?

2301
02:30:41,225 --> 02:30:43,265
You have the freedom to question me

2302
02:30:43,944 --> 02:30:50,744
When it comes to motherhood,
the choice and the right are mine alone!

2303
02:30:54,185 --> 02:30:56,464
Countdown for the voting has begun

2304
02:30:56,465 --> 02:30:58,944
The will of the land,
through every vote!

2305
02:31:01,344 --> 02:31:03,465
'Heavy voter turnout seen all over the state'

2306
02:31:03,944 --> 02:31:06,545
'Voters are casting votes enthusiastically'

2307
02:31:21,064 --> 02:31:24,145
Karunada People's Party sweeps
with a massive majority

2308
02:31:24,304 --> 02:31:29,024
'Karunada People's Party workers
are going all out in celebration!'

2309
02:31:29,344 --> 02:31:32,265
[Triumphant cheering]

2310
02:31:48,704 --> 02:31:51,545
Sir, since it's all gone your way

2311
02:31:52,344 --> 02:31:54,304
Shall I have Krishna drop the act now?

2312
02:31:55,744 --> 02:31:56,704
Nambiar...

2313
02:31:57,785 --> 02:31:59,585
Show ain't over yet!

2314
02:32:07,344 --> 02:32:09,825
Sir, no word from you about Krishna

2315
02:32:10,185 --> 02:32:11,344
Oww!

2316
02:32:11,465 --> 02:32:15,145
Uncs, I'm all set and ready for politics!

2317
02:32:15,265 --> 02:32:16,304
But one thing

2318
02:32:16,585 --> 02:32:20,344
the character you created
deserves a happy ending!

2319
02:32:22,505 --> 02:32:25,504
So tell me, will you take down
that costume-hero... or should I?

2320
02:32:25,505 --> 02:32:27,623
Dhanush! Have you lost it?

2321
02:32:27,624 --> 02:32:28,744
I'm telling you! Don't do this!

2322
02:32:29,145 --> 02:32:30,864
Everyone, clear out!

2323
02:32:30,865 --> 02:32:31,424
Okay, sir

2324
02:32:31,585 --> 02:32:33,063
Security, everybody out!

2325
02:32:33,064 --> 02:32:34,184
Sir, what's going on here?

2326
02:32:34,185 --> 02:32:35,303
How dare he challenges me!

2327
02:32:35,304 --> 02:32:36,264
He's innocent! Please no, sir!
- Stop!

2328
02:32:36,265 --> 02:32:37,344
Sir...

2329
02:32:37,785 --> 02:32:39,064
UNCS!

2330
02:32:39,225 --> 02:32:44,585
This attire and this attitude,
works for politics?

2331
02:32:48,384 --> 02:32:49,865
Victory to Karnataka!

2332
02:32:50,424 --> 02:32:53,865
Uncs, will the CM chair come here,
or do I have to go for it?

2333
02:32:55,225 --> 02:32:56,664
You costume-hero!

2334
02:32:57,064 --> 02:32:58,865
Original is always the original

2335
02:33:00,064 --> 02:33:02,825
Devil is always Devil

2336
02:33:03,624 --> 02:33:07,265
The lap Rukmini sits on is - MINE

2337
02:33:07,744 --> 02:33:10,865
the right to sit in CM's chair is also...

2338
02:33:13,664 --> 02:33:14,664
MINE!

2339
02:33:19,225 --> 02:33:20,464
Bravo, costume hero!

2340
02:33:20,465 --> 02:33:21,424
Bravo!

2341
02:33:22,344 --> 02:33:25,064
You act like me perfectly

2342
02:33:25,424 --> 02:33:29,585
but original is always original!

2343
02:33:30,785 --> 02:33:32,864
Krishna! Stop it, Krishna!

2344
02:33:32,865 --> 02:33:33,983
Uncs!

2345
02:33:33,984 --> 02:33:35,344
DEVIL!

2346
02:33:36,785 --> 02:33:39,343
Krishna! Stop, please!

2347
02:33:39,344 --> 02:33:42,104
Krishna, now's not the time for acting, listen!

2348
02:33:42,105 --> 02:33:44,505
You're comparing me
to this kitchen hand?

2349
02:33:45,704 --> 02:33:47,144
No, stop!

2350
02:33:47,145 --> 02:33:50,303
Sir, this is getting confusing!
Please, stop! I'm begging you!

2351
02:33:50,304 --> 02:33:54,144
You scoundrel! Your over-smart brain
brought all this confusion!

2352
02:33:54,145 --> 02:33:55,225
You deserve to die first!

2353
02:33:56,304 --> 02:33:57,505
Please don't harm Krishna, sir

2354
02:33:57,624 --> 02:33:59,224
He came on my word, sir!

2355
02:33:59,225 --> 02:34:01,584
In politics and power, I spare no one

2356
02:34:01,585 --> 02:34:03,424
For sympathy votes,
I even killed my wife!

2357
02:34:06,185 --> 02:34:08,505
You think I'll spare this damn kitchen hand?

2358
02:34:10,825 --> 02:34:11,624
What did you say?

2359
02:34:15,064 --> 02:34:17,743
Dear, why are you standing in the rain?

2360
02:34:17,744 --> 02:34:19,064
Come inside

2361
02:34:26,024 --> 02:34:27,105
What did you just say?

2362
02:34:30,704 --> 02:34:32,584
So.. Amma...
- Dhanush...

2363
02:34:32,585 --> 02:34:33,824
It wasn't an accident?

2364
02:34:33,825 --> 02:34:35,663
Not now, I'll explain later!

2365
02:34:35,664 --> 02:34:36,824
I want to know right now!

2366
02:34:36,825 --> 02:34:37,864
Later, I said!

2367
02:34:37,865 --> 02:34:39,144
I'm doing all of this for your sake

2368
02:34:39,145 --> 02:34:40,585
Move! I said move!

2369
02:35:04,905 --> 02:35:10,105
Even now, you couldn't
recognise your own son!

2370
02:35:24,024 --> 02:35:24,944
Ey!

2371
02:36:19,944 --> 02:36:23,225
I thought acting like Dhanush
was my ticket to becoming a hero

2372
02:36:23,704 --> 02:36:27,384
But now I'll have to keep
acting like him forever, sir

2373
02:36:28,225 --> 02:36:29,944
Still, it turned out for the better, no?

2374
02:36:31,465 --> 02:36:32,585
No, sir

2375
02:36:33,024 --> 02:36:34,744
Somehow my heart doesn't agree

2376
02:36:35,545 --> 02:36:38,424
I feel like I'm betraying
the people who believe in me

2377
02:36:39,225 --> 02:36:42,265
I feel like telling them the truth,
that I'm not Dhanush, I'm Krishna

2378
02:36:42,624 --> 02:36:43,785
Don't do that, Krishna

2379
02:36:44,265 --> 02:36:48,145
The truth might ease your heart,
but it'll only break theirs

2380
02:36:49,064 --> 02:36:51,905
When intentions are pure,
right or wrong don't matter

2381
02:36:55,785 --> 02:37:00,824
Respected Governor will formally
administer the oath of office to Dhanush

2382
02:37:00,825 --> 02:37:04,064
We now request Mr. Dhanush Rajashekar
to step onto the stage

2383
02:37:05,505 --> 02:37:07,984
Krishna... They're calling you on stage

2384
02:37:21,785 --> 02:37:25,344
'You're the road to every
atonement of mine, Krishna'

2385
02:37:28,984 --> 02:37:30,624
[Triumphant cheering]

2386
02:37:35,265 --> 02:37:36,865
I, Dhanush Rajashekar...

2387
02:37:53,024 --> 02:37:54,024
What next, sir?

2388
02:37:54,865 --> 02:37:56,664
You must be really tired, CM sir

2389
02:37:57,905 --> 02:37:59,024
Plenty still left to do

2390
02:37:59,384 --> 02:38:02,224
Rest for today, we'll talk tomorrow

2391
02:38:02,225 --> 02:38:03,145
Hmm

2392
02:38:09,585 --> 02:38:10,904
CM sir!

2393
02:38:10,905 --> 02:38:12,704
Come on, Rukku! Not you too!

2394
02:38:12,825 --> 02:38:15,943
From now on, you might be out
of reach for poor ones like me!

2395
02:38:15,944 --> 02:38:17,545
I'm CM only for the people

2396
02:38:18,185 --> 02:38:20,624
but for you, I'm still the same Krishna

2397
02:38:21,704 --> 02:38:22,744
I love you, Krishna!

2398
02:38:23,024 --> 02:38:23,825
Bye

2399
02:38:43,424 --> 02:38:44,664
Goodbye, Devil

2400
02:38:46,465 --> 02:38:47,984
'The Devil'

